WEBVTT

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:03.640
Groups of unemployed workers,
who have grown in number due to the tax reforms...

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:06.020
...enacted by the former Prime Minister, are rioting all across the country.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:09.600
And with the confusion among
members of Parliament sparked by the comments of...

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:13.070
...Finance Minister Takanashi during a recent Parliament inquiry...

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:16.110
There seems to be no compromise in
sight between the government and opposition.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:18.360
Hey.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:19.410
What will it be?

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.450
Give me three peanuts.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.790
Let's see here...

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.720
We've herded those Clown bastards onto Route 5.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:46.430
Don't scare me like that!

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:47.560
Open the damn door quietly!

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:51.060
You wouldn't be so jumpy if you didn't have something to hide!

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.400
Try selling some normal drinks sometime, huh?

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.240
How about buying something for once?!

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.360
This ain't a hangout!

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.410
And drink that dog piss you sell?!

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:09.830
Twin ceramic rotor drives on each wheel...

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.040
And these are...

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.590
Computer controlled anti-lock brakes...

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:18.050
200 horsepower at 12,000 rpm...

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:22.640
You wanna ride it, Tetsuo?

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:24.100
All right!

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.220
Let's go!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:29.230
That bike's been customized just for me.

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:29.890
It's too wild.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:30.980
You couldn't handle it.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.230
I don't see how you can ride something like that, man.

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:37.530
I could!

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:39.740
If you want one so bad...

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:41.280
Steal a big one for yourself.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:48.850
Unbelievable.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.640
School kids these days...

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.060
Wait! Hey, waiter!

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.190
They ran into the alley!

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.230
After 'em!

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:14.500
Geez...

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.000
This isn't a game, you idiot!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:20.960
Shit!

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:25.690
That's...

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:28.910
This is car 375.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:33.990
We've got reports of biker gangs
fighting near the intersection of Highway 14 south!

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.330
Request immediate assistance!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.580
Car 375, en route to the scene!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:39.710
It's the cops!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:40.210
What should we do?

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:43.210
And my motor coils were just getting warmed up...

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:50.340
Bastards...

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.430
Let's go, Tetsuo!

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:53.850
Right!

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.680
Damn, right!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:09.280
A skirmish has broken out between
student protesters and riot police assigned as security.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:10.910
There appear to be some casualties.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:11.820
Furthermore...

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:30.050
What the...

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.600
What the hell's going on?!

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:36.180
Move it, jerk!

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.430
I'm in a hurry!

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:38.850
Hey, move it!

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:54.200
What was that?!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.450
Call the police!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.290
Repeal the tax reforms!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:25.690
This area is off-limits!

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:26.560
It's dangerous!

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:27.940
Go back!

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.360
Something's strange here...

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:29.980
Let me through!

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.030
I'm sorry! Let me through!

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:31.900
What's the big idea?

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:40.950
Look!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:41.830
Blood!

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.210
Who are they?

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.330
Hey! Don't push!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.170
Excuse me.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.040
Hey! Watch it, jerk!

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.470
Pardon me.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:53.420
I'm sorry.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:55.050
Ryu!

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:57.140
Hey! He ran away!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.520
He's got a gun!

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:11.400
Fire!

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:14.780
Hold your fire!

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:16.030
There's a kid with him!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.540
Run...

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.000
Hurry...

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:34.260
Be careful!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:34.760
He's got a gun!

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:36.010
Go to Ryu...
He's got a gun!

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.890
Ryu will help you now...

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:44.730
Hurry...

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.310
Get out of here...

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:19.180
Kei!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:22.640
What are you doing?

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:23.470
Hurry!

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.480
He vanished...

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:39.910
He's to the west.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:41.950
The west?

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:43.910
He's in the old city then.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.170
Eat this!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:10.600
Tetsuo!

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:51.060
Ryu! Ryu!

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.390
Where are you?

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:56.940
Kei!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:24.760
No, that's...

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.320
How you like that?!

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:58.460
Well?

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.460
Who is it?

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:00.500
It's not him!

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.010
It's not Tetsuo!

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:03.090
Okay!

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:04.010
Let's go!

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:10.720
You little...

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:13.810
What did you do?

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:27.820
Tetsuo!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:29.490
Hang on! Hey!

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.290
What? What did you say?

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:34.960
That kid...

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:40.000
He's hurt bad!

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:42.090
Hey!

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.380
Wait!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:45.970
We gotta get him to a hospital!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:47.510
He needs an ambulance!

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.010
We can't move him!

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:00.060
W-What the hell?!

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.620
There's no escape.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.260
We've come for you.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:34.180
We can't survive on the outside.

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.060
Come on.

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:35.930
Let's go home.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.190
It's the army!

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:41.060
Those are army helicopters!

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:49.610
Move out!

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.090
Down on your bellies! Spread your arms and legs!

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:03.880
Um...

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.170
We're just, uh...

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.670
Down on your bellies! Spread your arms and legs!

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:18.730
Ow...

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.140
Damn it, that hurts!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.150
Kai!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.150
Hey!

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:29.360
Yes, sir?

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:30.280
Who are they?

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.410
They seem to be an ordinary biker gang, sir.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:49.550
We're going back.

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:52.180
Ow, ow!

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:53.050
Hey, wait a minute!

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:55.220
My arms don't bend that way, damn it!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.430
Load the wounded onto the helicopter!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.390
Tetsuo!

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:00.060
Wait!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.440
Where are you taking him?

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.100
Kaneda!

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.150
What the hell is wrong with you?

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.440
We didn't do anything!

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.690
H-He's heavy...

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:09.800
So...

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:15.130
You and your friends went out at night on your bikes to visit your dying mother.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:18.970
And a group of hooligans called the Clowns picked a fight with you.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:21.520
They hurt your friend, so you lost your temper...

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:25.270
...which is why eight Clown members are now in the hospital.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:26.440
That's your story?

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:28.860
She's cute!

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:31.320
Hey! You can't look at this!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:32.990
And how's your mother doing?!

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:33.860
Huh?

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.240
Luckily, she made it through the worst of it last night.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:40.490
And I suppose she's made it over the mountains on a bike by now?

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.210
It couldn't be these bozos.

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:50.340
You can tell that just by looking.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.260
Wait on that bench.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:54.420
Understand?

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:56.090
How much longer are we gonna have to wait?

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:58.390
Okay!

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.180
The next five, get in here!

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:04.770
So, the army's working with the police...

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:07.270
...to hunt down anti-government groups now, huh?

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:13.980
Wanna put up a fight, huh?

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.610
He's holding something!
Wanna put up a fight, huh?

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.950
You bastard!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.040
Long live the freedom revolution!

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:30.210
He's got a grenade!

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.130
Crazy son of a bitch!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.350
All right!

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.230
That's enough!

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:48.520
Take him away!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:51.020
We'll really teach him a lesson later.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:52.310
You dumb bastard!

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:54.900
If you wanna die, just hang yourself or something!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:55.690
Hey, you people!

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.190
You can go.

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:59.030
We've contacted your school.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:00.910
What? You son of a...

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.320
Hey, hold on a minute, pops!
What? You son of a...

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.080
"Pops"?!

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:06.700
There was one more of us.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.160
What?

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.620
Pardon me.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:13.790
What are you doing?

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:15.800
This is her.

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:16.800
Can she leave with us?

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.800
Who are you calling "pops", you punk?

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.180
Ow!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.220
Look here, kid!

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:23.930
I'm only 25!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.810
I'm not even married!

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.600
So, watch your mouth!

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:29.480
She can go with you!

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:33.060
Call a doctor!

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:38.740
So, I think the army was chasing that weird kid Kaneda saw...

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.650
I think I saw him, too.

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:42.360
And what about Tetsuo?

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.830
Why the hell wouldn't they tell us what hospital he's in?

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:46.330
What? What did you say?!

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:50.120
I was just wondering if you wanted to grab some tea or something over there.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:55.170
I figured we could have a nice, long talk about that "revolution" deal.

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:59.380
Skirt-chasers will try anything these days...

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:02.760
You'll help anyone so long as it's a girl, won't you?

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:03.800
No way!
You'll help anyone so long as it's a girl, won't you?

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:06.260
I have high standards!

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:06.850
But...

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.970
It's not their looks that count.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.140
It's their...

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:12.600
Their sensitivity that makes me do it...

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:15.230
I suppose I owe you one.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.980
Thank you very much, uh...

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:18.440
I'm Kaneda. Nice to meet you.

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:19.900
See you around, Kaneda-kun.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:22.400
You're leaving already?

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.990
Don't be like that!

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:24.780
Hey!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:25.950
Come on!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:28.290
I did save you and all!

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.420
At least tell me your name, you bitch!

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:40.210
I'll try talking with them for the time being...

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.050
But it's risky.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.970
If they think you're trying to avoid taking responsibility...

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:46.260
It'll blow up in your face.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.680
I can't believe that there's a mole on the executive council.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.680
Even if that's true...

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:55.020
That isn't important.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.480
What's important is diplomacy and political maneuvering...

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:59.480
...which you seem to despise.

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:01.990
I never studied them in school, you see.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:02.820
In any case...

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.910
At the next executive council meeting...

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:10.160
Your poor management of this last incident will be called into question.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.500
There's a phone call for the Colonel.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:20.500
You should put your affairs in order.

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:25.260
It's me.

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.450
This way, Colonel.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:51.700
I'm terribly sorry to call you here...

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:54.450
...but there's something you really must see.

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.170
Please observe.

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:03.760
It's the special pattern from that young boy.

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:06.090
It doesn't resemble any I've seen so far.

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:08.930
And I've never seen a developmental speed or configuration like this.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:12.350
It may have begun with the shock of contact with Number 26...

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:13.430
Or possibly...

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:16.480
Have you finished running a comparison with Akira's pattern?

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:18.230
I'll superimpose it over this one.

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:26.360
This projection was constructed using mixed data...

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.820
So, a comparison is difficult...

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:32.780
...but I believe this boy's pattern is the key to solving...

00:22:32.780 --> 00:22:35.410
...the riddle of Akira's pattern growth process.

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:36.750
All right.

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:37.540
Continue.

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:38.040
Very well, sir.

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:39.370
Thank you.

00:22:39.370 --> 00:22:42.880
I'm sure he'll turn out to be a worthy addition to the Numbers.

00:22:44.500 --> 00:22:46.380
It may be rough on him...

00:22:46.380 --> 00:22:49.470
...but I thought we might try starting him off with level 7 capsules.

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:51.140
Is it safe?

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:52.430
Leave everything to me.

00:22:52.430 --> 00:22:53.350
That's not what I meant!

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:59.690
I'm asking that if he turns out to have power like Akira's like you said...

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:02.770
Will we be able to control it?

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:04.520
Well, that's...

00:23:05.480 --> 00:23:06.820
Can I leave this to you?

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.400
Well...

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:12.910
If we use the latest examination equipment to collect even more data...

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:15.330
And do a multifaceted analysis...

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:16.490
Then, surely...

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:22.790
Maybe we shouldn't touch that power.

00:23:23.460 --> 00:23:25.670
The power of God?

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:31.550
Akira...

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:34.050
But we have to.

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:37.560
We have to touch it and control it.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:39.430
If it looks like it's too much for us to handle...

00:23:39.430 --> 00:23:40.810
Terminate him at once!

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:43.020
There can be no hesitation!

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:45.320
Very well, Colonel.

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:48.740
This school is your last chance!

00:23:48.740 --> 00:23:51.150
If trash like you that can't keep up with the academic ability of regular students...

00:23:51.150 --> 00:23:57.580
...and can't adapt to living in a group screw up here, it's the end of the road!

00:23:57.580 --> 00:24:01.500
Even if you're under 15, if you get more than 50 penalty points on your record...

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:03.540
You're sent to the regular courts!

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:04.500
Bite me!

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:05.920
Don't mess with us, you bald goat!

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:07.750
Aren't any of you listening?
Don't mess with us, you bald goat!

00:24:07.750 --> 00:24:09.090
You lost me halfway through!

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:10.260
Discipline!
You lost me halfway through!

00:24:10.260 --> 00:24:11.970
Discipline! Discipline!

00:24:11.970 --> 00:24:12.840
Ow!
Discipline! Discipline!

00:24:12.840 --> 00:24:13.130
Discipline! Discipline! Discipline!
Ow!

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.760
Discipline! Discipline! Discipline!

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:17.890
Dismissed!

00:24:18.770 --> 00:24:22.270
Thank you very much, sir!

00:24:23.480 --> 00:24:24.810
You bastard!

00:24:24.810 --> 00:24:26.820
You and me are gonna go at it someday, jack!

00:24:26.820 --> 00:24:27.770
We're gonna remember this!

00:24:27.770 --> 00:24:29.070
I hope you rot and die!

00:24:29.070 --> 00:24:30.860
You sick bastard!

00:24:30.860 --> 00:24:31.990
Shit...

00:24:37.450 --> 00:24:39.160
Yamagata-kun!

00:24:39.160 --> 00:24:41.120
What happened to your cheek?

00:24:41.120 --> 00:24:42.410
Shut the hell up.

00:24:42.410 --> 00:24:44.460
Let me guess, Jaws from P.E.?

00:24:44.460 --> 00:24:47.340
They say you fought the Clowns on a highway in the old city!

00:24:47.340 --> 00:24:47.710
Yeah.

00:24:47.710 --> 00:24:49.840
Why don't you just wipe 'em out?
Yeah.

00:24:49.840 --> 00:24:51.050
Those guys are so gross!

00:24:51.050 --> 00:24:52.760
And last night...
Those guys are so gross!

00:24:52.760 --> 00:24:54.720
There were demonstrators, cops, and even the damn army!

00:24:54.720 --> 00:24:56.720
And that idiot Tetsuo had an accident, too.

00:24:56.720 --> 00:24:58.390
What happened to Tetsuo-kun?

00:24:58.390 --> 00:24:59.510
He's in the hospital, I guess...

00:24:59.510 --> 00:25:00.390
...but we don't know where.

00:25:00.390 --> 00:25:02.640
The idiot was trying to show off.

00:25:05.850 --> 00:25:06.980
That idiot...

00:25:06.980 --> 00:25:07.770
What?

00:25:07.770 --> 00:25:08.980
You mean Tetsuo-kun?

00:25:08.980 --> 00:25:10.610
Shut up!

00:25:10.610 --> 00:25:12.110
I've had enough of your damn flirting!

00:25:12.110 --> 00:25:14.320
What's gotten into you?!

00:25:29.380 --> 00:25:30.550
Tetsuo-san?

00:25:31.000 --> 00:25:32.710
It's time for your medication.

00:25:33.880 --> 00:25:35.010
Doctor!

00:25:35.010 --> 00:25:36.430
There's a problem!

00:25:40.390 --> 00:25:41.640
I can't.

00:25:41.640 --> 00:25:45.390
The dorm mother throws a fit if you go out before 10.

00:25:45.390 --> 00:25:46.230
Yeah.

00:25:46.230 --> 00:25:48.400
The one with the face like a goat...

00:25:48.400 --> 00:25:50.400
That old bag's such a pain...

00:25:50.400 --> 00:25:51.780
She's always yammering on and on and on.

00:25:51.780 --> 00:25:53.530
What? Tomorrow at three?

00:25:53.530 --> 00:25:54.280
Sure.

00:25:54.280 --> 00:25:55.240
That'd be okay.

00:25:55.860 --> 00:25:58.490
What happened to that girl a while back?

00:25:58.490 --> 00:26:01.200
I don't like her much.

00:26:01.200 --> 00:26:02.740
Her personality just gets on my nerves...

00:26:02.740 --> 00:26:04.040
Kaori!

00:26:06.080 --> 00:26:07.750
Tetsuo-kun!

00:26:07.750 --> 00:26:10.500
Everyone's been worried about you!

00:26:10.500 --> 00:26:12.500
They thought you might be dead.

00:26:18.550 --> 00:26:20.350
When I woke up...

00:26:20.350 --> 00:26:23.470
I was on an operating table or something.

00:26:23.470 --> 00:26:25.600
And that examination...

00:26:25.600 --> 00:26:26.520
It's like...

00:26:27.390 --> 00:26:29.480
They were messing around inside my head.

00:26:30.190 --> 00:26:32.360
I don't want to go back there.

00:26:32.940 --> 00:26:33.940
Let's run away.

00:26:34.610 --> 00:26:36.150
Where?

00:26:37.530 --> 00:26:38.660
Someplace...

00:26:39.450 --> 00:26:41.830
Someplace far away...

00:26:44.660 --> 00:26:46.040
What's your problem?

00:26:46.040 --> 00:26:46.790
That's mine!

00:26:46.790 --> 00:26:48.000
I wanna get laid!
That's mine!

00:26:48.000 --> 00:26:49.540
Hey! Today's independent study!

00:26:49.540 --> 00:26:51.580
Say what?

00:26:51.580 --> 00:26:54.750
What about my burning desire to study?!

00:26:54.750 --> 00:26:56.460
Drag his butt in here!

00:26:57.920 --> 00:26:58.630
Kaneda!

00:26:58.630 --> 00:26:59.930
Your bike!

00:26:59.930 --> 00:27:01.260
My bike?

00:27:02.680 --> 00:27:03.930
Look!

00:27:07.430 --> 00:27:08.430
Tetsuo!

00:27:10.940 --> 00:27:12.400
Are you sure this is okay?

00:27:12.400 --> 00:27:12.940
Shut up!

00:27:12.940 --> 00:27:14.440
Just keep quiet and hang on!

00:27:25.870 --> 00:27:26.870
H-Huh?

00:27:26.870 --> 00:27:27.830
What's wrong?

00:27:30.330 --> 00:27:30.710
Shit!

00:27:30.710 --> 00:27:32.500
Oh, no...
Shit!

00:27:32.500 --> 00:27:35.130
We're stopping... We stopped.

00:27:36.250 --> 00:27:37.340
Oh, okay.

00:27:37.340 --> 00:27:40.680
The engine can't drop below 5,000 even when you're changing gears.

00:27:40.680 --> 00:27:41.680
My butt hurts.

00:27:41.680 --> 00:27:42.720
Okay, I get it...
My butt hurts.

00:27:42.720 --> 00:27:44.850
Look, bikes!

00:27:46.010 --> 00:27:47.930
Is that Kaneda-kun and...

00:27:47.930 --> 00:27:49.140
It's...

00:27:49.140 --> 00:27:50.140
Not them!

00:27:53.190 --> 00:27:54.190
Kaori!

00:27:58.150 --> 00:27:59.570
Any sign of him?

00:27:59.570 --> 00:28:01.820
Kuwata and the others went to look around Kisarazu.

00:28:01.820 --> 00:28:04.700
All that's left now is the industrial area!

00:28:04.700 --> 00:28:05.780
Okay.

00:28:05.780 --> 00:28:06.530
Let's go!

00:28:09.660 --> 00:28:12.920
We owe you for the other night!

00:28:21.420 --> 00:28:22.380
Shut up!

00:28:25.470 --> 00:28:26.350
Kaori!

00:28:26.350 --> 00:28:27.850
What did they do, Kaori?!

00:28:34.400 --> 00:28:35.610
Don't!

00:28:35.610 --> 00:28:38.190
If you even just scratch that bike...

00:28:38.190 --> 00:28:39.940
I'm gonna kill you!

00:28:45.740 --> 00:28:46.950
Run!

00:28:46.950 --> 00:28:48.410
Don't let 'em get away!

00:28:55.380 --> 00:28:56.420
Wait!

00:29:06.090 --> 00:29:07.760
Tetsuo!

00:29:24.610 --> 00:29:26.110
That's enough, Tetsuo!

00:29:26.110 --> 00:29:27.200
Are you trying to kill him?

00:29:27.200 --> 00:29:27.950
Yes!

00:29:27.950 --> 00:29:28.910
I'm gonna kill him!

00:29:28.910 --> 00:29:30.200
I'll split his damn head open!

00:29:30.200 --> 00:29:32.000
Knock it off!

00:29:32.000 --> 00:29:36.000
This happened because you took my bike for a joy ride.

00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:36.750
Enough, already!

00:29:36.750 --> 00:29:38.170
Shut up!

00:29:38.170 --> 00:29:40.630
Don't order me around!

00:29:40.630 --> 00:29:42.050
We were worried about you.

00:29:42.050 --> 00:29:44.880
Why do you always have to come and save me?

00:29:46.380 --> 00:29:48.010
I could've handled it myself!

00:29:48.010 --> 00:29:50.890
I admit I got beat up that one time...

00:29:50.890 --> 00:29:54.390
...but I won't always be on the receiving end!

00:29:54.770 --> 00:29:56.350
Understand?!

00:30:00.730 --> 00:30:02.150
Tetsuo-kun...

00:30:03.440 --> 00:30:04.150
Shut up!

00:30:04.150 --> 00:30:05.030
Stay away from me!

00:30:07.780 --> 00:30:08.990
Hey, wait!

00:30:08.990 --> 00:30:10.070
Where are you going?

00:30:11.450 --> 00:30:12.740
Leave me alone!

00:30:15.330 --> 00:30:16.210
Akira!

00:30:20.460 --> 00:30:21.420
Tetsuo!

00:30:24.840 --> 00:30:25.920
What's wrong?

00:30:27.180 --> 00:30:27.840
Akira!

00:30:27.840 --> 00:30:29.760
I don't know who that is!

00:30:52.530 --> 00:30:53.410
Tetsuo...

00:30:53.830 --> 00:30:54.790
Are you...

00:30:54.790 --> 00:30:55.290
Hey!

00:31:00.540 --> 00:31:02.340
This is strange.

00:31:02.340 --> 00:31:05.090
I'm getting a blue pattern on scope #3!

00:31:05.090 --> 00:31:06.510
Oh, no!

00:31:06.510 --> 00:31:07.970
Retrieve the subject!

00:31:07.970 --> 00:31:08.590
Hurry!

00:31:22.230 --> 00:31:24.980
What are you doing to my friend?!

00:31:28.110 --> 00:31:30.280
What's with you?

00:31:30.280 --> 00:31:32.240
You just come back from a funeral?

00:31:38.960 --> 00:31:40.250
Tetsuo!

00:31:40.710 --> 00:31:41.870
Kaneda!

00:31:43.250 --> 00:31:44.840
Shit...

00:31:53.930 --> 00:31:55.180
Wait!

00:32:02.190 --> 00:32:03.060
Hey.

00:32:03.060 --> 00:32:03.860
Kaneda...

00:32:15.780 --> 00:32:21.000
I see we have some youngsters doing their thing in spite of the tight checkpoints.

00:32:21.000 --> 00:32:24.500
That just means that they're stupid, don't it?

00:32:28.000 --> 00:32:29.260
This is boring.

00:32:29.260 --> 00:32:30.050
Hey.

00:32:30.050 --> 00:32:32.470
Let's go home.

00:32:32.470 --> 00:32:34.260
But it's still early!

00:32:34.260 --> 00:32:35.180
Yeah.

00:32:35.180 --> 00:32:38.260
Without their bikes, they're just skirt-chasers out of water.

00:32:38.260 --> 00:32:39.430
You mean "fish"!

00:32:39.430 --> 00:32:40.270
Come on, let's go.

00:32:40.270 --> 00:32:41.980
Let's toss these fish back!

00:32:42.770 --> 00:32:44.980
Hey, Kaneda.

00:32:44.980 --> 00:32:46.270
What are we gonna do?

00:32:48.770 --> 00:32:50.440
What the...

00:32:50.440 --> 00:32:51.280
Look!

00:33:17.600 --> 00:33:19.100
That's...

00:33:19.100 --> 00:33:20.770
Here we go again...

00:33:20.770 --> 00:33:22.680
Let's get out of here before we get involved again.

00:33:23.180 --> 00:33:24.020
Huh?

00:33:25.270 --> 00:33:26.400
Kaneda?

00:33:26.400 --> 00:33:27.690
Hey!

00:33:28.940 --> 00:33:33.280
This area is being cordoned off due to a terrorist bombing.

00:33:33.280 --> 00:33:35.610
Those who wish to get through, line up in single file...

00:33:35.610 --> 00:33:38.620
Present your ID and go through the checkpoint.

00:33:49.170 --> 00:33:49.960
Get in.

00:33:50.670 --> 00:33:51.800
What's wrong? Hurry.

00:33:51.800 --> 00:33:53.010
I'll be right behind you.

00:33:54.800 --> 00:33:56.050
You know the rendezvous point, right?

00:33:56.050 --> 00:33:56.800
Yeah.

00:33:57.760 --> 00:33:58.430
Be careful.

00:33:58.430 --> 00:33:59.640
Ryu!

00:33:59.640 --> 00:34:00.850
You too...

00:34:14.400 --> 00:34:15.240
Stop!

00:34:15.240 --> 00:34:16.400
Stop, damn it!

00:34:18.660 --> 00:34:20.410
She's got a gun!

00:34:31.540 --> 00:34:32.130
Okay!

00:34:32.130 --> 00:34:33.420
That's far enough!

00:34:34.050 --> 00:34:35.050
Drop the gun!

00:34:42.600 --> 00:34:44.060
Drop it now!

00:34:49.980 --> 00:34:51.310
Stop!

00:35:05.410 --> 00:35:07.290
I think it came from over here!

00:35:07.290 --> 00:35:08.080
There were two shots!

00:35:08.080 --> 00:35:09.170
No, three!

00:35:09.170 --> 00:35:10.330
It's just up ahead!

00:35:10.880 --> 00:35:12.000
Hey.

00:35:12.000 --> 00:35:12.960
Let's get out of here.

00:35:13.540 --> 00:35:14.380
Come on!

00:36:21.240 --> 00:36:22.360
Kaneda!

00:36:48.350 --> 00:36:49.100
So...

00:36:49.100 --> 00:36:50.560
What's the matter?

00:36:50.560 --> 00:36:52.060
Try telling me about it.

00:36:52.560 --> 00:36:55.060
I had a dream.

00:36:55.060 --> 00:36:56.440
A dream?

00:36:58.570 --> 00:37:01.530
The city will be covered by a dark shadow...

00:37:01.530 --> 00:37:03.570
...and start to crumble.

00:37:03.570 --> 00:37:06.370
Lots of people died...

00:37:06.370 --> 00:37:10.750
And we met Akira-kun again...

00:37:10.750 --> 00:37:11.620
Akira?!

00:37:12.120 --> 00:37:14.170
The city will crumble...

00:37:14.580 --> 00:37:18.380
...and so many people will die...

00:37:19.300 --> 00:37:20.500
When?!

00:37:21.300 --> 00:37:23.130
When will it happen, Kiyoko?!

00:37:23.130 --> 00:37:25.720
You mustn't let that boy go.

00:37:26.220 --> 00:37:28.390
His power is...

00:37:35.770 --> 00:37:36.480
What did she mean?!

00:37:36.480 --> 00:37:37.900
Um, well...

00:37:39.230 --> 00:37:42.820
There's nothing physically wrong with her.

00:37:42.820 --> 00:37:44.240
Her medication is normal, too.

00:37:44.240 --> 00:37:48.320
There's no sign of any abnormalities in her ECG or EEG, either.

00:37:48.950 --> 00:37:54.120
I think what Number 25 said was her precognitive power at work.

00:37:54.830 --> 00:37:58.420
This must be presented to the supreme executive council for inquiry, but...

00:37:59.670 --> 00:38:00.960
Do you believe her?

00:38:01.500 --> 00:38:03.880
I have no doubts regarding Number 25's abilities.

00:38:03.880 --> 00:38:06.220
We have all sorts of data that substantiate her abilities.

00:38:06.840 --> 00:38:08.720
What about you, Colonel?

00:38:09.640 --> 00:38:12.260
My job isn't to believe or disbelieve.

00:38:12.260 --> 00:38:14.230
It's to act or not to act.

00:38:26.740 --> 00:38:27.320
Here, sir.

00:38:27.320 --> 00:38:28.660
Um, Colonel...

00:38:28.660 --> 00:38:30.700
Please put some cold gear on.

00:38:30.700 --> 00:38:31.740
You, too, Doctor.

00:38:43.300 --> 00:38:47.630
The other day, a young researcher asked me something.

00:38:48.260 --> 00:38:52.300
He wondered if their power was the form
the next stage of human evolution was taking...

00:38:52.300 --> 00:38:56.520
...and perhaps that we'll all be able to control it some day.

00:38:57.940 --> 00:39:00.900
Scientists are a bunch of romantics.

00:39:00.900 --> 00:39:03.440
Military men always consider the risks first.

00:39:04.070 --> 00:39:06.780
It's taken thirty long years.

00:39:06.780 --> 00:39:09.700
We've come so far from the rubble.

00:39:10.740 --> 00:39:12.780
We can't just trade one for the other.

00:39:12.780 --> 00:39:17.710
I've always thought that you hated this city, Colonel.

00:39:17.710 --> 00:39:21.750
The passion to build has cooled and the joy of reconstruction forgotten.

00:39:23.170 --> 00:39:26.800
And now, it's just a garbage heap made up of hedonistic fools.

00:39:26.800 --> 00:39:30.010
So, you're trying to save the city then.

00:39:30.800 --> 00:39:32.720
It's how a soldier thinks.

00:39:32.720 --> 00:39:34.350
A scientist wouldn't understand.

00:39:38.270 --> 00:39:39.060
Colonel...

00:39:39.060 --> 00:39:40.060
We're here.

00:39:40.440 --> 00:39:41.400
This way, sir.

00:40:01.870 --> 00:40:05.630
Room 10, 148 degrees Kelvin.

00:40:05.630 --> 00:40:07.880
Fluctuation tolerance range, check.

00:40:08.420 --> 00:40:11.800
Room 9, 118 degrees Kelvin.

00:40:11.800 --> 00:40:13.090
Fluctuation tolerance, check.

00:40:13.090 --> 00:40:15.140
Emergency power generator, check.

00:40:16.010 --> 00:40:16.970
Open it.

00:40:16.970 --> 00:40:17.720
Yes, sir.

00:40:18.430 --> 00:40:18.970
Um...

00:40:18.970 --> 00:40:20.270
Go to the Control Room!

00:40:20.270 --> 00:40:21.140
Yes, sir!

00:40:38.240 --> 00:40:42.330
Room 1 is at 0.0005 degrees Kelvin.

00:40:42.330 --> 00:40:44.250
It's within tolerances.

00:40:44.250 --> 00:40:48.710
No abnormalities detected in any
of the rooms' Dewar Walls or in the defense system.

00:40:49.210 --> 00:40:53.180
No abnormal atmospheric concentrations or reactions recorded.

00:40:53.180 --> 00:40:55.680
All systems nominal then?

00:41:04.940 --> 00:41:06.810
Look at what they abandoned in their panic.

00:41:06.810 --> 00:41:08.360
They were afraid!

00:41:08.360 --> 00:41:10.900
They were too scared, so they hid it away from the public.

00:41:10.900 --> 00:41:13.400
They forgot all shame and honor...

00:41:13.400 --> 00:41:17.490
...and cast off the civilization and science we had created...

00:41:17.910 --> 00:41:22.250
...and shut the lid of the Pandora's Box they themselves had opened.

00:41:26.920 --> 00:41:27.630
Ryu!

00:41:27.630 --> 00:41:29.880
Hey, we're still young.

00:41:29.880 --> 00:41:30.050
Ryu!
Hey, we're still young.

00:41:30.050 --> 00:41:30.670
I think we can start over.
Ryu!

00:41:30.670 --> 00:41:32.670
I think we can start over.

00:41:32.670 --> 00:41:34.130
I'll go with you to the police.

00:41:34.130 --> 00:41:35.260
Ryu!

00:41:35.260 --> 00:41:36.800
Come on, turn yourself in!

00:41:36.800 --> 00:41:38.720
That was the first time you ever killed somebody, right?

00:41:38.720 --> 00:41:39.760
Ryu!

00:41:39.760 --> 00:41:40.430
Anyway...

00:41:40.430 --> 00:41:42.680
Once you've purified your body and soul...

00:41:42.680 --> 00:41:44.520
Let's go out for tea or something.

00:41:45.100 --> 00:41:47.190
Don't kick yourself over it, okay?

00:41:47.190 --> 00:41:49.190
What's done is done.

00:41:49.190 --> 00:41:51.150
The guy's dead.

00:41:58.160 --> 00:41:59.200
Who are you?!

00:42:00.530 --> 00:42:01.870
Ryu...

00:42:01.870 --> 00:42:03.250
You're okay!

00:42:03.250 --> 00:42:04.080
Is that you, Kei?

00:42:04.080 --> 00:42:05.080
Ryu!

00:42:05.960 --> 00:42:07.170
Who's this?

00:42:08.210 --> 00:42:09.920
Who, me?

00:42:09.920 --> 00:42:11.920
Well, I guess...

00:42:11.920 --> 00:42:15.970
Saying I'm Kei-chan's boyfriend might be stretching it a bit.

00:42:15.970 --> 00:42:16.880
But...

00:42:16.880 --> 00:42:19.430
We haven't gotten physical or anything yet, understand?

00:42:19.430 --> 00:42:20.050
Are you a spy?!

00:42:20.050 --> 00:42:20.680
No!

00:42:20.680 --> 00:42:21.970
Liar!

00:42:26.690 --> 00:42:28.400
Is he really okay?

00:42:28.400 --> 00:42:30.560
All I know for sure is that he's not a spy.

00:42:31.730 --> 00:42:33.030
Ow...

00:42:35.190 --> 00:42:37.240
Sneak into their lab?!

00:42:37.240 --> 00:42:38.530
Are you serious?

00:42:38.530 --> 00:42:40.070
Don't you remember the fiasco with that kid?!

00:42:40.070 --> 00:42:41.530
Last-minute orders...

00:42:41.530 --> 00:42:43.410
Besides, the plan's already in place.

00:42:46.580 --> 00:42:49.210
The lab passes they issue once a week!

00:42:49.630 --> 00:42:51.420
They're from Nezu-sama?

00:42:51.420 --> 00:42:53.090
What's the objective?

00:42:53.090 --> 00:42:55.840
Detailed data on the new subject...

00:42:55.840 --> 00:42:57.420
New subject?

00:42:57.420 --> 00:42:58.300
Yes.

00:42:58.880 --> 00:43:00.260
Last week...

00:43:00.260 --> 00:43:03.850
On the night we tried to abduct the subject called Number 26...

00:43:04.720 --> 00:43:08.730
A boy who was in an accident on an old city highway was brought to the lab.

00:43:09.520 --> 00:43:12.110
Looks like he's a student at a vocational training school...

00:43:12.110 --> 00:43:15.280
...but he's now their new subject for human experimentation.

00:43:19.280 --> 00:43:20.700
Ow!

00:43:20.700 --> 00:43:22.120
Ow, ow, ow!

00:43:22.120 --> 00:43:24.280
What's the big idea?!

00:43:24.280 --> 00:43:25.290
You!

00:43:25.290 --> 00:43:26.120
He heard us!

00:43:26.120 --> 00:43:26.870
Let's kill him!

00:43:26.870 --> 00:43:27.790
Ryu!

00:43:27.790 --> 00:43:29.460
W-Wait a minute!

00:43:29.460 --> 00:43:30.370
Listen to me!

00:43:30.370 --> 00:43:31.790
Listen to what I have to say!

00:43:31.790 --> 00:43:32.790
He saved me!

00:43:32.790 --> 00:43:34.130
Twice!

00:43:34.130 --> 00:43:36.300
Maybe it was just to get close to us.

00:43:36.300 --> 00:43:39.800
The guy who was in that accident in the old city is a friend of mine!

00:43:39.800 --> 00:43:41.970
I know it's hard to believe...

00:43:41.970 --> 00:43:43.010
...but it's the truth!

00:43:43.010 --> 00:43:45.060
I was there when it happened!

00:43:45.760 --> 00:43:46.930
Please...

00:43:46.930 --> 00:43:49.730
Don't they say the only foolish questions are unasked ones?

00:43:49.730 --> 00:43:50.730
Huh?

00:43:51.440 --> 00:43:52.480
They don't?

00:43:53.770 --> 00:43:56.230
That's an intriguing story.

00:43:56.940 --> 00:43:59.900
Will you be taking the boy with you?

00:43:59.900 --> 00:44:01.660
He knows the subject...

00:44:01.660 --> 00:44:04.490
And I think we can use him as a decoy if necessary.

00:44:04.490 --> 00:44:07.450
Neo Tokyo is going to change.

00:44:08.700 --> 00:44:11.710
In all respects, this city is saturated.

00:44:11.710 --> 00:44:14.080
It's like an overripe fruit.

00:44:14.080 --> 00:44:16.710
And within it is a new seed.

00:44:16.710 --> 00:44:20.590
We only need to wait for the wind which will make it fall.

00:44:20.590 --> 00:44:23.220
The wind called Akira!

00:44:24.090 --> 00:44:24.800
Ryu!

00:44:25.470 --> 00:44:26.470
Look!

00:44:27.600 --> 00:44:28.930
What is it?

00:44:28.930 --> 00:44:31.600
We aren't the ones who will change it...

00:44:31.600 --> 00:44:34.770
...but rather, those citizens who hope for Akira will.

00:44:35.770 --> 00:44:39.690
That which is called science perverts providence!

00:44:39.690 --> 00:44:42.910
That which is called progress encourages extravagance!

00:44:42.910 --> 00:44:47.580
That which is called civilization devastates the spirit of man!

00:44:47.580 --> 00:44:51.660
The time of atonement is upon us!

00:44:51.660 --> 00:44:53.710
The time of his awakening is nigh!

00:44:53.710 --> 00:44:57.380
The time of Lord Akira's awakening draws near!

00:44:57.380 --> 00:44:58.630
Are your hearts prepared?!

00:44:58.630 --> 00:45:00.670
Break up this illegal gathering!
Are your hearts prepared?!

00:45:00.670 --> 00:45:03.050
Holding meetings here is prohibited!

00:45:03.050 --> 00:45:05.050
Break up this illegal gathering!

00:45:05.680 --> 00:45:08.310
Terrorist activities carried out by...

00:45:08.310 --> 00:45:11.930
...anti-government elements have skyrocketed this month.

00:45:11.930 --> 00:45:16.100
The army, riot police, and even traffic police have been fully mobilized.

00:45:16.100 --> 00:45:19.610
The overtime costs alone have used up the public safety budget.

00:45:19.610 --> 00:45:22.110
And then, there's the abduction of Number 26!

00:45:22.110 --> 00:45:25.320
Isn't their existence supposed to be highest of state secrets?

00:45:25.320 --> 00:45:28.740
No one's ever heard of "Peace and Order" here in Neo Tokyo then?

00:45:28.740 --> 00:45:29.910
And then...

00:45:29.910 --> 00:45:32.450
There's this request of yours...

00:45:32.450 --> 00:45:37.460
...for further funding because of subject Number 25's prediction.

00:45:37.460 --> 00:45:39.090
You must be joking!

00:45:39.090 --> 00:45:44.380
We Parliament members have been begging the public to bear with us...

00:45:44.380 --> 00:45:49.640
...while we straighten out the former
Prime Minister's historic tax reform blunders...

00:45:49.640 --> 00:45:52.640
So, where exactly are we supposed to get that kind of money?!

00:45:52.640 --> 00:45:54.730
You've spent a fortune...

00:45:54.730 --> 00:45:57.270
And all we have to show for it is that grotesque kindergarten!

00:45:57.270 --> 00:45:58.860
The Olympics are next year.

00:45:58.860 --> 00:46:00.070
The postwar period is over.

00:46:00.070 --> 00:46:03.690
How much longer will you keep spending money on some ghost?!

00:46:03.690 --> 00:46:07.030
I always said that we should've put that money into the welfare program!

00:46:07.030 --> 00:46:08.160
Shut up, old man!

00:46:08.160 --> 00:46:09.030
What?!

00:46:09.030 --> 00:46:13.120
That power is starting to walk around free as we speak.

00:46:13.120 --> 00:46:15.040
Unless we control it now...

00:46:15.040 --> 00:46:15.790
We'll lose everything!

00:46:15.790 --> 00:46:18.580
Who do you think you're talking to, youngster?
We'll lose everything!

00:46:18.580 --> 00:46:21.710
It was your lack of policy that started this mess in the first place!

00:46:21.710 --> 00:46:26.220
There's still no proof that the last World War was caused by Akira!

00:46:26.220 --> 00:46:30.390
Won't you even try to understand anything at all...

00:46:30.390 --> 00:46:32.350
...unless an Akira disaster actually happens?!

00:46:32.350 --> 00:46:35.100
Has anyone actually seen this "Akira"?

00:46:35.100 --> 00:46:37.690
Wasn't Akira Number 25?

00:46:37.690 --> 00:46:39.480
No, I think he was Number 21...

00:46:39.480 --> 00:46:42.730
The Colonel has lost sight of his duty as a soldier.

00:46:43.480 --> 00:46:45.940
I've had reports that anti-government elements are using...

00:46:45.940 --> 00:46:51.740
...this "Akira" madness of yours as an excuse to whip up their terrorist fervor!

00:46:51.740 --> 00:46:52.620
No!

00:46:52.620 --> 00:46:53.660
That's untrue!

00:46:53.660 --> 00:46:56.500
Then, what about that Akira world renewal movement?

00:46:56.500 --> 00:46:58.420
Wouldn't you say that information's being leaked?

00:46:58.420 --> 00:47:00.290
World renewal movement?

00:47:00.290 --> 00:47:01.920
End of the world, more like!

00:47:01.920 --> 00:47:05.960
Aren't you just using Akira as camouflage to cover up your misconduct?

00:47:05.960 --> 00:47:07.170
What are you getting at?

00:47:07.880 --> 00:47:09.300
Colonel...

00:47:09.300 --> 00:47:13.390
We can no longer leave the peace...

00:47:13.390 --> 00:47:16.430
...of Neo Tokyo to your sole discretion.

00:47:16.430 --> 00:47:17.140
Right!

00:47:17.140 --> 00:47:21.150
You are to be put before an inquiry committee.

00:47:21.150 --> 00:47:22.020
I agree!

00:47:25.900 --> 00:47:27.110
Excuse me!

00:47:27.690 --> 00:47:28.650
Colonel!

00:47:29.200 --> 00:47:29.820
Colonel, where are you...

00:47:29.820 --> 00:47:31.160
Wait!
Colonel, where are you...

00:47:31.160 --> 00:47:32.450
This discussion isn't over yet!

00:47:32.450 --> 00:47:34.160
Explain yourself!

00:47:34.160 --> 00:47:37.000
Are you trying to insult the supreme executive council?!

00:47:37.000 --> 00:47:38.000
Colonel!

00:47:38.000 --> 00:47:39.580
Wait, Colonel!

00:48:02.060 --> 00:48:03.360
W-Water...

00:48:36.470 --> 00:48:38.430
Hey, wait a minute...

00:48:39.560 --> 00:48:42.190
Isn't that cable replacement scheduled for next week?

00:48:42.190 --> 00:48:43.400
Yeah.

00:48:43.400 --> 00:48:46.020
The cable they ordered came in early.

00:48:46.020 --> 00:48:47.020
Besides...

00:48:47.020 --> 00:48:50.320
I'm going on vacation at the end of the week.

00:48:50.320 --> 00:48:52.740
I've brought some workers with me, too.

00:48:53.610 --> 00:48:55.910
I could take it back...

00:48:55.910 --> 00:48:57.740
...but the work's gonna be done sooner or later.

00:49:03.250 --> 00:49:04.750
Okay, let's go.

00:50:35.510 --> 00:50:36.510
What the...

00:51:06.120 --> 00:51:07.160
Milk?

00:51:15.510 --> 00:51:16.670
Stay away!

00:51:30.020 --> 00:51:31.020
Blood!

00:51:31.020 --> 00:51:32.270
I'm scared!

00:51:41.280 --> 00:51:42.370
Jerk!

00:51:42.370 --> 00:51:45.330
W-Who the hell are they?

00:52:40.920 --> 00:52:42.630
Room 887...

00:52:42.630 --> 00:52:44.180
Shima Tetsuo...

00:52:44.720 --> 00:52:46.760
A problem with the automatic lock?

00:52:51.940 --> 00:52:53.140
Hey!

00:52:53.140 --> 00:52:54.940
You can't just walk away from your room!

00:52:59.940 --> 00:53:00.740
Come on.

00:53:00.740 --> 00:53:01.950
Let's go back.

00:53:01.950 --> 00:53:02.990
What the hell happened?

00:53:02.990 --> 00:53:04.740
What a mess!

00:53:27.390 --> 00:53:31.560
There are 58 blocks with circuits that the computer won't display.

00:53:31.560 --> 00:53:36.060
Of those, nearly 40 are concentrated on underground levels 7 and 8.

00:53:36.060 --> 00:53:37.230
That's probably the place.

00:53:39.440 --> 00:53:42.150
The central wiring shaft should be up ahead.

00:53:42.150 --> 00:53:44.570
We should be able to use it to go straight to the sublevels.

00:53:46.200 --> 00:53:47.530
Be careful.

00:53:47.530 --> 00:53:49.280
It's deeper in the middle.

00:53:49.280 --> 00:53:51.240
What a stink!

00:53:51.240 --> 00:53:52.040
Quiet!

00:53:52.040 --> 00:53:52.910
What?

00:53:52.910 --> 00:53:55.250
I said it stinks because it stinks!

00:53:55.250 --> 00:53:56.210
Is your nose busted?

00:53:56.210 --> 00:53:57.790
Hurry up and stay quiet!

00:53:59.590 --> 00:54:00.210
Damn!

00:54:00.210 --> 00:54:01.500
Hide!

00:54:02.960 --> 00:54:03.550
Where?

00:54:03.550 --> 00:54:04.470
You idiot!

00:54:04.470 --> 00:54:05.380
What are you doing?!

00:54:19.480 --> 00:54:20.520
They left?

00:54:21.190 --> 00:54:22.900
Looks like they've beefed up security.

00:54:22.900 --> 00:54:24.690
Must be that siren we heard.

00:54:24.690 --> 00:54:26.150
What should we do? Scout around some?

00:54:26.150 --> 00:54:26.910
No.

00:54:27.570 --> 00:54:28.820
Are you okay?
Let's keep going.

00:54:28.820 --> 00:54:31.370
I want to check out their security at the very least.

00:54:31.370 --> 00:54:31.910
All right.

00:54:32.580 --> 00:54:33.700
We've been spotted!

00:54:33.700 --> 00:54:34.660
Run!

00:54:35.710 --> 00:54:36.710
Shit!

00:54:36.710 --> 00:54:38.210
Don't!

00:54:38.210 --> 00:54:39.330
Don't shoot!

00:54:42.090 --> 00:54:44.380
Shimazaki!

00:54:44.380 --> 00:54:46.010
Shit!

00:54:46.010 --> 00:54:46.930
Forget about him!

00:54:46.930 --> 00:54:47.880
Run!

00:54:51.350 --> 00:54:53.310
What the hell is that?

00:54:54.770 --> 00:54:55.640
Here it comes!

00:54:56.890 --> 00:54:57.560
Forget it!

00:54:57.560 --> 00:54:58.310
You can't do any good!

00:55:04.070 --> 00:55:05.610
Die!

00:55:06.650 --> 00:55:08.360
This is Unit 304, Shaft H!

00:55:08.360 --> 00:55:10.910
Have encountered intruders and am engaging!

00:55:10.910 --> 00:55:11.870
Request backup!

00:55:12.870 --> 00:55:14.120
Here it comes!

00:55:40.270 --> 00:55:41.270
Kei!

00:55:44.110 --> 00:55:44.980
Where's that gun?!

00:55:45.780 --> 00:55:47.990
Damn it!

00:55:50.280 --> 00:55:51.320
Kaneda-kun!

00:56:01.750 --> 00:56:02.380
Kei!

00:56:02.380 --> 00:56:03.420
This way!

00:56:04.340 --> 00:56:05.800
Hurry!

00:56:07.710 --> 00:56:09.970
Hurry, Kaneda-kun!

00:56:25.150 --> 00:56:26.770
Kaneda-kun!

00:56:39.750 --> 00:56:41.540
The brakes! Where are the brakes?!

00:56:41.540 --> 00:56:43.170
That's not it?

00:56:43.170 --> 00:56:45.170
This is the central wiring shaft!

00:56:45.170 --> 00:56:46.960
It's gotta be this one then!

00:56:52.550 --> 00:56:53.840
Okay.

00:56:53.840 --> 00:56:55.550
I'm getting the hang of this!

00:56:56.010 --> 00:56:58.060
Ask the Colonel for clearance to fire!

00:56:58.060 --> 00:56:59.430
Turn that up!

00:57:00.350 --> 00:57:01.850
There must be some mistake.

00:57:01.850 --> 00:57:04.600
That boy looks like the patient they admitted to the lab.

00:57:04.600 --> 00:57:07.820
The boy, the subject named Shima Tetsuo, broke out of his room.

00:57:07.820 --> 00:57:10.070
I think he's headed for the Baby Room.

00:57:10.070 --> 00:57:11.320
Tetsuo?!

00:57:11.320 --> 00:57:12.950
He is in an extremely dangerous state!

00:57:12.950 --> 00:57:14.110
Don't let him through!

00:57:14.110 --> 00:57:15.160
I repeat...

00:57:15.160 --> 00:57:16.820
Do not let him through!

00:57:44.810 --> 00:57:45.600
What the...

00:57:53.650 --> 00:57:55.360
It's no use hiding.

00:57:55.360 --> 00:57:56.610
We have no choice then.

00:57:56.610 --> 00:57:57.740
Use your guns!

00:57:57.740 --> 00:58:00.740
We can't let him go any farther, no matter what it takes!

00:58:02.000 --> 00:58:03.290
Fire!

00:58:43.620 --> 00:58:45.460
So, here you are...

00:58:50.670 --> 00:58:51.880
Stop it!

00:58:54.380 --> 00:58:56.880
How long are you gonna keep playing around?!

00:59:03.720 --> 00:59:05.640
Where'd the other one go?

00:59:07.270 --> 00:59:08.350
Why, you...

00:59:10.020 --> 00:59:11.270
Die!

00:59:13.860 --> 00:59:15.610
Takashi!

00:59:25.580 --> 00:59:28.790
What the hell is going on?

00:59:28.790 --> 00:59:30.750
Am I dreaming or something?

00:59:30.750 --> 00:59:34.250
I never knew I had powers like this!

00:59:41.550 --> 00:59:43.810
Which way should I go?!

00:59:43.810 --> 00:59:45.850
Straight.

00:59:45.850 --> 00:59:47.310
Straight ahead...

00:59:47.310 --> 00:59:48.810
Huh?

00:59:48.810 --> 00:59:50.810
There's a freight elevator.

00:59:52.810 --> 00:59:55.480
We can take it to sublevel 8.

01:00:03.780 --> 01:00:05.200
Good.

01:00:05.200 --> 01:00:06.790
You're all together.

01:00:08.250 --> 01:00:11.000
You thought you could kill me?

01:00:11.830 --> 01:00:14.130
You tried to mess with me...

01:00:14.130 --> 01:00:15.960
I'm gonna kill you!

01:00:21.630 --> 01:00:23.890
That was you...

01:00:23.890 --> 01:00:25.510
Takashi!

01:00:25.510 --> 01:00:27.560
Let's attack him together!

01:00:27.560 --> 01:00:29.230
O-Okay.

01:00:33.980 --> 01:00:35.900
You little twerps!

01:00:52.290 --> 01:00:53.960
That's enough! All of you!

01:01:02.220 --> 01:01:04.010
Who the hell are you?!

01:01:07.850 --> 01:01:08.970
What's the matter?

01:01:08.970 --> 01:01:11.060
Does your head hurt, Shima Tetsuo?

01:01:11.060 --> 01:01:13.230
Your power isn't fully matured.

01:01:13.230 --> 01:01:15.560
If you push yourself, you might do irreparable damage.

01:01:15.560 --> 01:01:17.360
Just do as we tell you.

01:01:17.730 --> 01:01:22.610
What the hell did you people do to my head?!

01:01:31.000 --> 01:01:33.210
Calm yourself, Shima Tetsuo!

01:01:33.210 --> 01:01:35.120
He can't control it.

01:01:40.050 --> 01:01:41.550
What?!

01:01:41.550 --> 01:01:47.180
She said that big people like you should never use the power like that.

01:01:47.180 --> 01:01:48.800
She says something horrible will happen.

01:01:49.760 --> 01:01:51.560
Mind your own business.

01:01:54.060 --> 01:01:55.020
What?

01:01:55.730 --> 01:01:57.560
More powerful than me?

01:01:59.980 --> 01:02:01.070
He's the one!

01:02:01.480 --> 01:02:05.280
He's been popping in and out of my head lately!

01:02:05.280 --> 01:02:06.110
Where is he?!

01:02:06.110 --> 01:02:08.070
Where's this "Akira"?!

01:02:08.070 --> 01:02:08.820
What?!

01:02:08.820 --> 01:02:10.370
Kiyoko said...

01:02:10.370 --> 01:02:12.580
...that you'll awaken Akira-kun.

01:02:13.080 --> 01:02:16.000
If that happens, no one will be able to stop him.

01:02:16.000 --> 01:02:17.710
So, before that can happen, we have to stop you.

01:02:17.710 --> 01:02:18.670
Impossible!

01:02:18.670 --> 01:02:19.710
Akira's already...

01:02:19.710 --> 01:02:22.460
Where is he?!

01:02:23.970 --> 01:02:25.260
Stop it!

01:02:25.260 --> 01:02:26.510
Shut up!

01:02:32.180 --> 01:02:36.020
Threat level to facility integrity has passed level 7.

01:02:36.020 --> 01:02:39.440
Enacting disaster protocols.

01:02:40.440 --> 01:02:43.860
Threat level to facility integrity has passed level 7.

01:02:43.860 --> 01:02:47.110
Enacting disaster protocols.

01:02:47.110 --> 01:02:48.950
What the...

01:02:55.790 --> 01:02:57.000
Hands up!

01:03:00.380 --> 01:03:02.500
Where the hell is the "Baby Room"?!

01:03:14.720 --> 01:03:16.350
Oh, no! Run!

01:03:21.400 --> 01:03:23.770
Gangway, coming through! Coming through!

01:03:23.770 --> 01:03:25.360
Damn it, move!

01:03:27.450 --> 01:03:28.610
Kiyoko...

01:03:48.590 --> 01:03:50.510
Damn, that hurt...

01:03:50.510 --> 01:03:51.550
Kaneda?

01:03:52.090 --> 01:03:54.010
What are you doing here?

01:03:56.850 --> 01:03:57.890
Tetsuo!

01:03:57.890 --> 01:03:58.770
Are you okay?

01:03:58.770 --> 01:04:00.060
I'm here to rescue you!

01:04:02.020 --> 01:04:04.020
Hurry up, you moron!

01:04:04.520 --> 01:04:06.320
If we don't get out of here, those guys outside are gonna...

01:04:08.070 --> 01:04:09.240
There he is!

01:04:09.240 --> 01:04:10.570
Catch him!

01:04:12.740 --> 01:04:14.490
Stay away from me!

01:04:19.040 --> 01:04:20.080
Kaneda-kun!

01:04:22.710 --> 01:04:25.210
Oh, right. I forgot you were there.

01:04:27.210 --> 01:04:29.420
That's okay, Kaneda.

01:04:29.420 --> 01:04:33.220
I won't be needing you to save me anymore.

01:04:34.050 --> 01:04:36.810
From now on, I'll be saving you.

01:04:36.810 --> 01:04:40.230
All you have to do is ask, Kane-chan.

01:04:40.230 --> 01:04:41.890
Say what?

01:04:41.890 --> 01:04:45.110
Who the hell do you think you're talking to?!

01:04:45.980 --> 01:04:48.900
You don't like the way I talk?

01:04:48.900 --> 01:04:50.490
Does it make you mad?

01:04:50.490 --> 01:04:52.070
What are you gonna do about it?!

01:04:52.070 --> 01:04:53.610
Huh, Kaneda?!

01:04:53.610 --> 01:04:55.620
What are you gonna do about it?!

01:05:05.500 --> 01:05:06.840
That's enough!

01:05:07.590 --> 01:05:10.800
Don't hurt anyone else!

01:05:12.170 --> 01:05:14.090
Where's this "Akira" guy?!

01:05:14.800 --> 01:05:15.760
He...

01:05:17.100 --> 01:05:19.010
The Olympic stadium?

01:05:19.010 --> 01:05:20.020
In an underground facility?

01:05:20.390 --> 01:05:21.270
No!

01:05:21.270 --> 01:05:22.270
You're wrong!

01:05:22.270 --> 01:05:23.480
Akira-kun is...

01:05:25.730 --> 01:05:26.560
Wait!

01:05:36.870 --> 01:05:37.660
What the hell?

01:05:38.530 --> 01:05:41.080
I can do this, too?!

01:05:47.170 --> 01:05:48.210
Kiyoko...

01:05:48.210 --> 01:05:49.380
Are you okay?

01:05:49.380 --> 01:05:51.340
It doesn't look like she's hurt.

01:05:51.340 --> 01:05:52.760
What about you, Masaru-kun?

01:05:52.760 --> 01:05:54.180
You're bleeding.

01:05:54.180 --> 01:05:55.550
What happened to him?

01:05:56.470 --> 01:05:57.550
He flew away.

01:05:57.550 --> 01:05:59.810
How can he have so much power?

01:06:02.390 --> 01:06:04.520
How could this have happened?

01:06:04.520 --> 01:06:06.230
Is anyone here?

01:06:06.230 --> 01:06:09.940
He's developed so much power in such a short time...

01:06:09.940 --> 01:06:10.900
Find him!

01:06:10.900 --> 01:06:12.440
Find Tetsuo!

01:06:12.440 --> 01:06:15.240
Kaneda-kun! Hang on, Kaneda!
Find him! Go after him!

01:06:15.240 --> 01:06:15.700
Find him! Go after him!

01:06:15.700 --> 01:06:17.200
Hurry up!

01:06:17.200 --> 01:06:18.700
Get that rubble cleared!

01:06:20.780 --> 01:06:22.580
He went to where Akira-kun is.

01:06:22.580 --> 01:06:23.450
What?

01:06:24.000 --> 01:06:26.500
You're all safe!

01:06:26.500 --> 01:06:30.340
He's heading for the facility below the Olympic construction site.

01:06:30.340 --> 01:06:32.000
How did Tetsuo find out about that?!

01:06:36.130 --> 01:06:39.300
You mean he's gone outside?

01:06:42.220 --> 01:06:43.220
Damn it!

01:06:43.220 --> 01:06:44.480
We'll follow him!

01:06:44.480 --> 01:06:45.730
Prepare for pursuit!

01:06:45.730 --> 01:06:47.310
Yes, sir!
He's heading west!

01:06:47.310 --> 01:06:50.020
He's heading for the Olympic construction site!

01:06:50.020 --> 01:06:52.780
Tell them to beef up their security!

01:06:52.780 --> 01:06:53.030
Set up checkpoints on all...

01:06:53.030 --> 01:06:54.360
You...

01:06:54.360 --> 01:06:54.780
Set up checkpoints on all...

01:07:00.740 --> 01:07:05.540
According to the defense team, intruders were encountered in the wiring shaft.

01:07:05.540 --> 01:07:07.370
Two disguised as workers resisted and were shot, and the rest are at large.

01:07:07.370 --> 01:07:10.080
He has to be stopped before his powers mature...

01:07:10.080 --> 01:07:11.540
Two disguised as workers resisted and were shot, and the rest are at large.

01:07:12.960 --> 01:07:15.210
Your objective is the boy Shima Tetsuo.

01:07:15.670 --> 01:07:19.090
If we are unable to capture him, you will lure him out to the old city and attack.

01:07:19.090 --> 01:07:21.510
Request assistance from the Eastern District Battalion.

01:07:21.510 --> 01:07:22.100
Yes, sir!

01:07:22.100 --> 01:07:24.100
Tell them there isn't a moment to lose!

01:07:26.560 --> 01:07:28.810
I've been waiting for you, Colonel.

01:07:29.900 --> 01:07:31.190
Who the hell are you?!

01:07:33.320 --> 01:07:37.190
I'm here to inform you of the supreme executive council's decision.

01:07:39.320 --> 01:07:43.700
"At 2400 hours today, the Colonel is hereby stripped of his command and rank...

01:07:43.700 --> 01:07:46.200
...and will be placed under arrest."

01:07:46.200 --> 01:07:47.370
What?!

01:07:48.210 --> 01:07:49.750
Please come with us.

01:07:50.790 --> 01:07:54.840
You expect me to hand Neo Tokyo over to those fools at a time like this?

01:07:57.840 --> 01:07:58.550
Shoot him.

01:07:58.550 --> 01:07:59.300
Yes, sir!

01:07:59.300 --> 01:08:00.130
What?

01:08:01.220 --> 01:08:02.970
W-Wait!

01:08:04.100 --> 01:08:05.600
Enough!

01:08:05.600 --> 01:08:07.560
Open your eyes and look at the big picture!

01:08:08.140 --> 01:08:11.020
We can't dance to the tune of corrupt politicians and capitalists!

01:08:15.570 --> 01:08:16.860
Don't you understand?!

01:08:16.860 --> 01:08:18.990
It's pointless to fight anymore!

01:08:23.370 --> 01:08:25.160
Announce a state of emergency...

01:08:25.160 --> 01:08:27.750
Arrest all members of the executive council...

01:08:27.750 --> 01:08:29.460
...and remove them from the chain of command!

01:08:30.580 --> 01:08:32.370
We're going after Tetsuo!

01:08:32.370 --> 01:08:36.380
Urgent message to all district battalion commanders!

01:08:46.180 --> 01:08:46.930
Hey.

01:08:47.850 --> 01:08:48.640
What's up?

01:08:48.640 --> 01:08:49.770
You by yourself?

01:08:52.100 --> 01:08:54.650
Weren't you in an accident or something?

01:08:54.650 --> 01:08:56.520
Everybody's been worried.

01:08:57.070 --> 01:08:57.900
So, you feeling better?

01:08:57.900 --> 01:09:00.650
Gimme some capsules.

01:09:01.860 --> 01:09:02.570
Hey.

01:09:02.570 --> 01:09:03.860
Are you sure about that?

01:09:04.410 --> 01:09:05.740
You don't look so hot.

01:09:05.740 --> 01:09:07.790
Just hand 'em over!

01:09:08.910 --> 01:09:10.950
All right, if you say so.

01:09:10.950 --> 01:09:14.960
But with all those demonstrations and terrorist attacks lately, things are rough.

01:09:15.540 --> 01:09:19.130
They're hard to come by, so they're pretty expensive.

01:09:25.800 --> 01:09:27.260
Tetsuo's run off...

01:09:27.260 --> 01:09:28.720
Kaneda's disappeared...

01:09:28.720 --> 01:09:30.470
I guess the team's finished.

01:09:30.470 --> 01:09:33.600
And the checkpoints are so strict...

01:09:33.600 --> 01:09:35.940
Even the Clowns are staying put.

01:09:45.360 --> 01:09:45.910
What's wrong?

01:09:49.540 --> 01:09:51.330
He's dead!

01:09:51.330 --> 01:09:52.250
What?!

01:09:54.870 --> 01:09:55.870
What the...

01:10:01.840 --> 01:10:02.970
Tetsuo?

01:10:02.970 --> 01:10:07.050
What are you doing here?

01:10:07.890 --> 01:10:10.560
You want some, too?

01:10:10.560 --> 01:10:12.470
What are you talking about?!

01:10:12.470 --> 01:10:13.890
What the hell happened here?!

01:10:14.350 --> 01:10:16.440
The barkeeper's dead!

01:10:20.230 --> 01:10:22.940
A fish out of water dies, huh?

01:10:22.940 --> 01:10:23.990
You are...

01:10:25.110 --> 01:10:27.610
...Tetsuo, aren't you?

01:10:29.120 --> 01:10:31.160
Kaneda sends his regards.

01:10:31.160 --> 01:10:33.160
You saw Kaneda?!

01:10:33.160 --> 01:10:35.210
He's probably dead by now.

01:10:38.210 --> 01:10:42.210
You did this, Tetsuo?

01:10:42.210 --> 01:10:43.920
So, anyway...

01:10:43.920 --> 01:10:46.720
Where's Kaneda's bike?

01:10:46.720 --> 01:10:47.840
Tetsuo!

01:10:48.930 --> 01:10:51.140
I don't need a piece of junk like that anymore.

01:10:51.140 --> 01:10:52.560
You son of a...

01:10:58.310 --> 01:10:59.480
Yamagata!

01:11:06.360 --> 01:11:07.990
Shit...

01:11:15.120 --> 01:11:17.040
He went to where Akira is?

01:11:17.040 --> 01:11:18.920
That's what that girl said.

01:11:19.420 --> 01:11:23.840
The army, you, and Ryu are all looking for this "Akira" guy...

01:11:23.840 --> 01:11:25.670
So, that's why you're chasing after Tetsuo.

01:11:26.170 --> 01:11:28.380
It has something to do with that power of Tetsuo's, right?

01:11:29.130 --> 01:11:30.220
So...

01:11:30.220 --> 01:11:32.350
What the hell is this "Akira" thing you keep talking about?

01:11:35.470 --> 01:11:37.390
Ryu told me about it once.

01:11:37.390 --> 01:11:40.150
He said that Akira is absolute energy.

01:11:40.560 --> 01:11:42.610
Absolute energy?

01:11:42.610 --> 01:11:44.270
Humans...

01:11:44.270 --> 01:11:46.610
They do all kinds of things during their lifetime, right?

01:11:46.610 --> 01:11:49.110
Discovering things...

01:11:49.110 --> 01:11:50.280
Building things...

01:11:51.570 --> 01:11:54.200
Things like houses, motorcycles...

01:11:54.830 --> 01:11:58.000
Bridges, cities, and rockets...

01:11:59.080 --> 01:12:00.790
All that knowledge and energy...

01:12:00.790 --> 01:12:02.250
Where do you suppose it comes from?

01:12:04.000 --> 01:12:07.460
Humans were like monkeys once, right?

01:12:07.920 --> 01:12:10.970
And before that, like reptiles and fish...

01:12:11.640 --> 01:12:15.310
And before that, plankton and amoebas...

01:12:15.310 --> 01:12:19.890
Even creatures like those have incredible energy inside them.

01:12:19.890 --> 01:12:23.480
Because of genes, I guess.

01:12:23.480 --> 01:12:25.520
And even before that...

01:12:25.520 --> 01:12:28.150
Maybe there were genes in the water and air.

01:12:28.780 --> 01:12:30.900
Even in space dust, too, I bet.

01:12:31.360 --> 01:12:32.990
If that's true...

01:12:32.990 --> 01:12:35.660
What memories are hidden in it?

01:12:35.660 --> 01:12:37.830
The beginning of the universe, maybe.

01:12:37.830 --> 01:12:39.540
Or maybe even before that...

01:12:39.540 --> 01:12:40.960
Hey! Hey, hey!

01:12:40.960 --> 01:12:42.580
What's the matter?

01:12:42.580 --> 01:12:43.670
Are you okay?

01:12:43.670 --> 01:12:46.130
Did you get hit on the head back there?

01:12:46.130 --> 01:12:49.760
Maybe everyone has those memories.

01:12:49.760 --> 01:12:53.090
What if there were some mistake and the progression went wrong...

01:12:53.090 --> 01:12:57.470
...and something like an amoeba were given power like a human's?

01:12:59.220 --> 01:13:01.020
That's what Akira is?

01:13:01.890 --> 01:13:04.690
Amoebas don't build houses and bridges.

01:13:05.230 --> 01:13:08.030
They just devour all the food around them.

01:13:08.030 --> 01:13:09.480
That's what Tetsuo's doing?

01:13:10.240 --> 01:13:12.530
You're saying he has that kind of energy?!

01:13:12.530 --> 01:13:13.910
A long time ago...

01:13:14.320 --> 01:13:17.490
There were people who tried to control that power.

01:13:17.490 --> 01:13:19.540
At the government's request, you see...

01:13:19.540 --> 01:13:22.000
They failed...

01:13:22.000 --> 01:13:24.540
And it triggered the Fall of Tokyo.

01:13:25.330 --> 01:13:29.340
That power is still too much for...

01:13:31.550 --> 01:13:32.550
What?!

01:13:33.380 --> 01:13:34.550
The door's unlocked.

01:13:38.350 --> 01:13:39.180
Huh?

01:13:44.560 --> 01:13:47.730
This has got to be a trap.

01:13:47.730 --> 01:13:48.860
Go back then.

01:13:48.860 --> 01:13:50.030
No.

01:13:50.030 --> 01:13:52.690
We ought to find out how much of it is a trap.

01:13:54.860 --> 01:13:56.070
By the way...

01:13:56.660 --> 01:13:59.530
What's with you and that Ryu guy?

01:14:00.040 --> 01:14:01.200
What do you mean?

01:14:01.200 --> 01:14:02.200
You're always together.

01:14:02.200 --> 01:14:04.160
That's none of your business!

01:14:04.960 --> 01:14:06.880
What I'm saying is...

01:14:06.880 --> 01:14:08.920
He doesn't know about us, does he?

01:14:09.920 --> 01:14:10.840
Us?

01:14:10.840 --> 01:14:12.300
Hey, wait a minute!

01:14:12.300 --> 01:14:13.590
What's that supposed to mean?

01:14:14.260 --> 01:14:15.800
Do you think this will work?

01:14:15.800 --> 01:14:17.720
It can't be helped.

01:14:17.720 --> 01:14:19.010
At this point...

01:14:19.010 --> 01:14:22.270
Our only option is to use her.

01:14:22.270 --> 01:14:29.190
The fact that she turned up right under our noses says as much, I think.

01:14:29.190 --> 01:14:30.440
I guess...

01:14:44.250 --> 01:14:47.370
Have arrived at Ward 13, East Ginza intersection.

01:14:47.370 --> 01:14:48.500
Over.

01:14:48.500 --> 01:14:51.250
Northern District battalion has not responded to mobilization request.

01:14:52.050 --> 01:14:54.760
Special search team to HQ! Special search team to HQ!

01:14:54.760 --> 01:14:58.260
We're at the Harukiya snack bar near the highway interchange in Ward 8.

01:14:58.930 --> 01:15:04.100
It doesn't look like a bomb explosion, so we think it was him.

01:15:04.980 --> 01:15:08.810
It was almost certainly the work of the subject that escaped from the lab.

01:15:08.810 --> 01:15:09.480
Yes, sir!

01:15:09.940 --> 01:15:10.520
Yes, sir!

01:15:10.520 --> 01:15:11.360
Understood!

01:15:18.360 --> 01:15:19.360
Kaneda!

01:15:20.570 --> 01:15:21.700
What?!

01:15:21.700 --> 01:15:23.200
Yamagata's dead?!

01:15:23.200 --> 01:15:25.500
Something seemed strange about him from the second I saw him.

01:15:26.040 --> 01:15:28.960
He was wearing what looked like a white hospital gown.

01:15:28.960 --> 01:15:30.580
It was like he was a different person.

01:15:32.130 --> 01:15:33.300
Yamagata...

01:15:33.880 --> 01:15:36.630
...asked him if he was really Tetsuo.

01:15:37.090 --> 01:15:38.300
And then...

01:15:39.430 --> 01:15:41.140
Yamagata, he...

01:15:44.390 --> 01:15:46.060
We've always been together.

01:15:46.890 --> 01:15:48.770
I've known him since we were in the children's home...

01:15:50.810 --> 01:15:52.900
I've known everything about him.

01:15:53.440 --> 01:15:54.730
He was a klutz...

01:15:54.730 --> 01:15:56.690
And everybody made him cry...

01:15:58.360 --> 01:15:59.780
Oh, right...

01:15:59.780 --> 01:16:02.240
He wanted to know where your bike was.

01:16:02.910 --> 01:16:04.200
My bike?

01:16:13.040 --> 01:16:14.170
What are you gonna do?

01:16:15.750 --> 01:16:17.510
I'm gonna send Yamagata his bike.

01:16:22.640 --> 01:16:24.760
You dumb bastard!

01:16:28.270 --> 01:16:29.310
Kaneda!

01:16:45.990 --> 01:16:47.120
Kei!

01:16:47.490 --> 01:16:48.830
What's wrong?

01:16:52.830 --> 01:16:53.880
You!

01:16:54.750 --> 01:16:55.590
You were there that night...

01:16:59.340 --> 01:17:00.220
Wait!

01:17:06.890 --> 01:17:07.930
Kei!

01:17:11.940 --> 01:17:13.100
They disappeared!

01:17:14.860 --> 01:17:18.190
You were the ones who changed Tetsuo too, weren't you?

01:17:18.190 --> 01:17:22.860
Akira's power exists within everyone.

01:17:23.450 --> 01:17:24.240
Who's there?!

01:17:25.700 --> 01:17:26.620
But...

01:17:26.620 --> 01:17:29.080
When that power is awakened...

01:17:29.080 --> 01:17:32.210
You must choose how to use it.

01:17:32.210 --> 01:17:36.590
Even if you weren't prepared for it...

01:17:38.380 --> 01:17:41.210
And he has made his choice.

01:17:42.670 --> 01:17:46.640
Tetsuo-kun is our newest companion.

01:17:48.100 --> 01:17:52.230
We're partly to blame for his actions.

01:17:52.230 --> 01:17:53.310
Then...

01:17:53.310 --> 01:17:55.230
Why did you take Kei then?!

01:17:55.230 --> 01:17:58.230
We want her to help us.

01:17:58.230 --> 01:18:00.230
You can't just use people like that!

01:18:00.230 --> 01:18:01.530
Bring Kei back!

01:18:01.530 --> 01:18:03.610
Tetsuo's our friend!

01:18:03.610 --> 01:18:05.740
If anyone's gonna kill him, it should be us!

01:18:08.450 --> 01:18:09.740
Hey!

01:18:10.910 --> 01:18:12.250
Damn it!

01:18:12.250 --> 01:18:16.250
Omi-sama and the other executives have been arrested by the coup?

01:18:16.750 --> 01:18:17.790
Y-Yes, that's right.

01:18:17.790 --> 01:18:20.340
T-The house guards are fighting them right now.

01:18:20.340 --> 01:18:22.090
Y-Yes.

01:18:22.090 --> 01:18:24.800
I'd like to have a helicopter waiting at West Haneda.

01:18:24.800 --> 01:18:25.590
Yes.

01:18:26.760 --> 01:18:28.390
That damned Colonel...

01:18:28.390 --> 01:18:29.970
I can't believe he's taken up arms.

01:18:33.060 --> 01:18:34.640
I underestimated him.

01:18:39.270 --> 01:18:40.230
Hold them here!

01:18:40.230 --> 01:18:41.270
Damn!

01:19:11.890 --> 01:19:13.140
Nezu-sama...

01:19:15.770 --> 01:19:17.060
Is that you, Ryu?!

01:19:17.060 --> 01:19:19.150
I'm sorry, sir...

01:19:19.150 --> 01:19:21.690
The mission was a failure.

01:19:21.690 --> 01:19:23.440
What are you doing here?!

01:19:23.440 --> 01:19:25.440
I've told you, you can't be seen here!

01:19:27.150 --> 01:19:28.530
All of my men...

01:19:29.030 --> 01:19:31.120
They've all been killed.

01:19:31.120 --> 01:19:33.290
Y-You bastard!

01:19:33.290 --> 01:19:34.620
You sold me out, didn't you?!

01:19:34.620 --> 01:19:36.040
W-What?

01:19:39.670 --> 01:19:40.580
Kei...

01:19:46.760 --> 01:19:48.510
I got fresh fish in here, buddy!

01:19:48.510 --> 01:19:49.720
I'm gonna get compensated for 'em, right?

01:19:49.720 --> 01:19:50.720
Please...

01:19:50.720 --> 01:19:52.970
I have to catch a flight at noon!

01:19:53.970 --> 01:19:54.930
What?

01:19:55.600 --> 01:19:57.600
7th Avenue is just ahead!

01:19:57.600 --> 01:19:59.600
It intersects this road 100 meters from here!

01:20:04.270 --> 01:20:05.650
Prepare for battle!

01:20:14.530 --> 01:20:15.080
Right.

01:20:15.660 --> 01:20:17.160
We've spotted the subject.

01:20:19.080 --> 01:20:20.670
What? Attack?!

01:20:20.670 --> 01:20:21.960
But he's just a...

01:20:22.460 --> 01:20:24.170
We're attacking a boy?!

01:20:28.260 --> 01:20:29.630
Look! There he is!

01:20:29.630 --> 01:20:30.510
Impossible!

01:20:30.510 --> 01:20:31.760
Is this for real?

01:20:43.860 --> 01:20:45.440
Firing preparations complete.

01:20:48.280 --> 01:20:49.320
Damn it!

01:20:49.320 --> 01:20:49.940
Fire!

01:21:03.290 --> 01:21:04.380
Akira!

01:21:04.380 --> 01:21:05.630
It's Lord Akira!

01:21:05.630 --> 01:21:07.670
It's the advent of Lord Akira!

01:21:08.550 --> 01:21:09.090
That's not him!

01:21:09.090 --> 01:21:10.510
Don't be fooled!

01:21:10.510 --> 01:21:11.300
That's not Lord Akira!

01:21:11.300 --> 01:21:12.340
Shut up!
That's not Lord Akira!

01:21:13.800 --> 01:21:16.100
Long live Lord Akira!

01:21:16.850 --> 01:21:18.390
Fire!

01:21:19.390 --> 01:21:20.560
Huh?

01:21:20.560 --> 01:21:21.430
What's wrong?

01:22:49.230 --> 01:22:52.190
Neo Tokyo Broadcasting is exclusively covering the news...

01:22:52.190 --> 01:22:55.240
...in spite of martial law in the name of freedom of the press!

01:22:55.240 --> 01:22:59.070
What in the world is happening here in Neo Tokyo?

01:22:59.070 --> 01:23:02.120
What you see here seems to be fires caused by tank cannons.

01:23:02.120 --> 01:23:05.250
But who is this young boy?

01:23:05.250 --> 01:23:08.210
Is he fighting the coup forces all by himself?

01:23:08.210 --> 01:23:09.290
Viewers...

01:23:09.290 --> 01:23:14.920
The army has just illegally ordered us to land!

01:23:14.920 --> 01:23:15.970
Freedom of the press is now in jeopardy!

01:23:17.130 --> 01:23:18.890
What happened? Were they cut off?

01:23:19.760 --> 01:23:20.390
The bridge!

01:23:20.390 --> 01:23:21.720
He's heading for the bridge!

01:23:23.430 --> 01:23:24.680
All right! Let's go see!

01:23:41.490 --> 01:23:43.490
Are you really going alone?

01:23:44.490 --> 01:23:46.700
He wants this, doesn't he?

01:23:47.290 --> 01:23:49.620
We should call the gang together.

01:23:50.500 --> 01:23:51.380
Hey!

01:23:51.920 --> 01:23:54.050
I wouldn't want to keep him waiting.

01:23:56.170 --> 01:23:57.340
Hey, Kaneda!

01:23:57.340 --> 01:23:58.300
Wait!

01:24:05.220 --> 01:24:08.100
Half seem to be anti-government demonstrators.

01:24:08.100 --> 01:24:08.640
The rest are...

01:24:08.640 --> 01:24:12.360
Well, they're more like some crazy cult than onlookers.

01:24:12.360 --> 01:24:15.440
They're following after the subject, and more and more keep coming.

01:24:18.610 --> 01:24:23.070
Oh, flames of purity!

01:24:23.070 --> 01:24:25.700
Raze this corrupt city!

01:24:25.700 --> 01:24:31.370
Consume our unclean hearts!

01:24:31.370 --> 01:24:33.750
Fear not!

01:24:33.750 --> 01:24:39.130
Your bodies will be purified in the flames!

01:24:40.130 --> 01:24:41.260
Ready!

01:24:43.390 --> 01:24:44.640
Fire!

01:24:50.230 --> 01:24:53.560
Set the switch to hold for three seconds and converge your beams!

01:24:54.270 --> 01:24:55.440
Aim!

01:24:55.440 --> 01:24:57.030
Fire!

01:25:02.530 --> 01:25:04.200
Watch this!

01:25:10.330 --> 01:25:11.160
Look out!

01:25:11.160 --> 01:25:12.210
Let's get out of here!

01:25:23.050 --> 01:25:25.090
Help me!

01:25:31.480 --> 01:25:32.440
Ground forces!

01:25:32.440 --> 01:25:34.190
Ground forces, come in!

01:25:34.190 --> 01:25:36.520
Report! What is the subject's status?!

01:25:36.520 --> 01:25:37.610
Ground forces!

01:25:39.690 --> 01:25:41.440
Call the Doctor.

01:25:41.440 --> 01:25:44.780
We have confirmation of his recent movements and are in pursuit.

01:25:44.780 --> 01:25:46.240
His present position is...

01:25:46.240 --> 01:25:47.200
Let's see...

01:25:47.200 --> 01:25:52.460
Coordinates 99871 by 4332.

01:25:52.460 --> 01:25:56.290
That's about 2 km south of the Olympic construction site in the old city.

01:25:56.290 --> 01:25:57.460
What?!

01:26:02.760 --> 01:26:04.470
What was that?

01:26:05.010 --> 01:26:05.930
Look!

01:26:06.760 --> 01:26:09.760
That's near the toll booth that's being guarded by the 2nd platoon.

01:26:10.810 --> 01:26:11.680
What?

01:26:13.020 --> 01:26:13.980
Huh?

01:26:16.980 --> 01:26:18.150
Please turn around!

01:26:18.150 --> 01:26:20.980
This area's off limits to civilians!

01:26:20.980 --> 01:26:22.240
Huh? What?

01:26:22.240 --> 01:26:23.740
That's the subject?!

01:26:23.740 --> 01:26:25.280
S-Stop!

01:26:25.280 --> 01:26:26.490
Stop, damn it!

01:27:32.350 --> 01:27:34.680
Nice place you have here.

01:27:41.900 --> 01:27:43.650
You...

01:27:43.650 --> 01:27:45.150
You were with Kaneda...

01:27:45.150 --> 01:27:49.200
You shouldn't use your power this way.

01:27:49.860 --> 01:27:50.950
What?

01:27:50.950 --> 01:27:55.700
In the end, you won't be able to control it.

01:27:55.700 --> 01:27:57.290
The kids...

01:27:57.290 --> 01:27:58.750
You're those brats, aren't you?!

01:28:16.930 --> 01:28:18.940
Okay, then!

01:28:40.540 --> 01:28:41.540
What the...

01:28:53.300 --> 01:28:54.550
It's not safe here, Colonel!

01:29:35.680 --> 01:29:37.010
Well...

01:29:37.010 --> 01:29:38.140
What are you gonna do?

01:31:05.180 --> 01:31:06.600
Open up!

01:31:17.410 --> 01:31:19.490
What the hell is this?

01:31:19.490 --> 01:31:22.490
That's Akira, Tetsuo!

01:31:22.490 --> 01:31:26.040
That's the "Akira" you wanted to meet.

01:31:26.040 --> 01:31:28.540
There's your Messiah!

01:31:28.540 --> 01:31:31.290
After his transcendental awakening...

01:31:31.290 --> 01:31:35.800
His body was subjected to every test known to science.

01:31:35.800 --> 01:31:37.300
And...

01:31:37.300 --> 01:31:40.300
That's what was left of it.

01:31:49.100 --> 01:31:53.440
The scientists back then were unable to solve the mystery.

01:31:53.440 --> 01:31:57.780
So, they decided to entrust their collected data and test samples...

01:31:57.780 --> 01:32:01.160
...to future generations by preserving them in a frozen capsule.

01:32:03.280 --> 01:32:04.160
SOL...

01:32:04.160 --> 01:32:04.990
We'll use SOL!

01:32:04.990 --> 01:32:05.660
Sir?

01:32:08.080 --> 01:32:11.210
Akira is already dead!

01:32:11.210 --> 01:32:12.420
Well?

01:32:12.420 --> 01:32:14.630
Are you satisfied now, Tetsuo?

01:32:19.180 --> 01:32:20.180
Now...

01:32:20.180 --> 01:32:21.680
Come back with us!

01:32:21.680 --> 01:32:23.180
Like hell!

01:32:24.140 --> 01:32:26.350
Contact the central defense center...

01:32:26.350 --> 01:32:29.890
And tell them to patch us through to SOL's control circuits!

01:32:29.890 --> 01:32:30.520
Yes, sir!

01:32:47.500 --> 01:32:49.120
Hey, watch it!

01:32:49.120 --> 01:32:50.500
Damn it, move!

01:32:50.500 --> 01:32:51.870
Out of the way!

01:32:51.870 --> 01:32:53.130
Get out of the way!

01:33:09.390 --> 01:33:12.560
What is this? Science class?

01:33:29.160 --> 01:33:31.040
What's wrong?

01:33:31.040 --> 01:33:32.250
Having some trouble?

01:33:32.250 --> 01:33:33.540
Yeah...

01:33:33.540 --> 01:33:35.540
...but I already took care of it.

01:33:36.170 --> 01:33:38.250
If you were here earlier, you could've watched the show.

01:33:38.250 --> 01:33:41.170
You had me worried again.

01:33:41.170 --> 01:33:44.390
I figured you'd be standing here, sobbing like a little baby.

01:33:44.390 --> 01:33:45.470
Kaneda...

01:33:46.050 --> 01:33:48.560
You've always been a pain in the ass.

01:33:49.220 --> 01:33:50.770
Ever since we were kids...

01:33:50.770 --> 01:33:53.980
You've been telling me what to do.

01:33:53.980 --> 01:33:56.060
You always treat me like a kid.

01:33:56.060 --> 01:33:59.070
You always show up and start bossing me around!

01:33:59.070 --> 01:34:01.240
And now, you're a boss, too...

01:34:01.240 --> 01:34:03.070
Of this pile of rubble...

01:34:03.070 --> 01:34:04.280
Kaneda!

01:34:04.280 --> 01:34:06.990
That's Kaneda-san to you, punk!

01:34:07.370 --> 01:34:09.620
Die!

01:34:18.920 --> 01:34:20.500
Tetsuo!

01:34:44.450 --> 01:34:45.530
Son of a...

01:34:59.170 --> 01:35:00.170
Kei!

01:35:02.170 --> 01:35:03.670
Oh, hell!

01:35:07.220 --> 01:35:09.680
Let's do it!

01:35:20.480 --> 01:35:22.480
Got him!

01:35:23.280 --> 01:35:24.490
Huh?

01:35:29.530 --> 01:35:31.160
The battery?!

01:35:31.160 --> 01:35:32.950
What's the matter, Kaneda?

01:35:34.500 --> 01:35:35.540
God damn it!

01:35:35.540 --> 01:35:36.910
This ain't fair, Tetsuo!

01:35:36.910 --> 01:35:38.460
Fight with your bare hands!

01:35:41.880 --> 01:35:43.000
Oh, this is funny...

01:35:45.010 --> 01:35:46.970
Feeling frustrated, Kaneda?

01:35:47.630 --> 01:35:50.720
Do you understand how it feels now?

01:35:56.730 --> 01:35:59.230
What's this light?

01:36:09.860 --> 01:36:11.160
Well? Did you hit him?

01:36:11.160 --> 01:36:12.990
We're too close to the impact point.

01:36:12.990 --> 01:36:14.160
There's too much electrical interference...

01:36:14.160 --> 01:36:15.660
Prepare a second volley!

01:36:38.270 --> 01:36:41.020
Hey!

01:36:41.020 --> 01:36:42.940
Kaneda!

01:37:01.250 --> 01:37:04.290
Tetsuo!

01:37:04.290 --> 01:37:04.920
Huh?

01:37:19.220 --> 01:37:20.980
Shit...

01:37:21.480 --> 01:37:22.560
Huh?

01:37:22.560 --> 01:37:23.850
What? What the...

01:37:59.600 --> 01:38:01.680
Correcting for tracking system error.

01:38:01.680 --> 01:38:03.600
T-minus 20 to energy alteration.

01:38:03.600 --> 01:38:04.480
Fire extinguishers!

01:38:04.480 --> 01:38:05.190
Are you okay?

01:38:05.190 --> 01:38:06.150
Hurry! Hurry!

01:38:06.150 --> 01:38:07.310
What happened?

01:38:07.310 --> 01:38:08.110
What's going on?

01:38:17.410 --> 01:38:19.450
Kaneda!

01:38:20.910 --> 01:38:22.200
Kai! Kei!

01:38:22.200 --> 01:38:22.620
Kaneda!

01:38:22.620 --> 01:38:23.830
Kaneda-kun!
Kaneda!

01:38:23.830 --> 01:38:24.620
Get on!

01:38:24.620 --> 01:38:25.870
Get on? Where?

01:38:25.870 --> 01:38:27.420
Hurry! Hurry!

01:38:49.690 --> 01:38:51.150
What's that?

01:39:05.460 --> 01:39:07.170
They say it's SOL.

01:39:18.390 --> 01:39:19.720
Magnificent...

01:39:29.690 --> 01:39:33.940
When Tetsuo-kun's power reaches its peak?

01:39:33.940 --> 01:39:35.860
That's when we do it.

01:39:35.860 --> 01:39:36.780
But...

01:39:36.780 --> 01:39:38.410
Will it work?

01:39:39.360 --> 01:39:44.410
The future doesn't proceed along a single course.

01:39:44.410 --> 01:39:48.290
There ought to be a future we can choose.

01:39:57.800 --> 01:39:59.550
What's Tetsuo's status?

01:40:00.180 --> 01:40:01.010
Colonel...

01:40:02.100 --> 01:40:05.060
We set up a camera in the stadium a while ago.

01:40:05.060 --> 01:40:06.600
We have him under observation.

01:40:08.190 --> 01:40:12.480
You must take a look at this data, Colonel!

01:40:12.480 --> 01:40:15.780
We're still analyzing the energy given off by the subject, but...

01:40:15.780 --> 01:40:18.610
It's absolutely magnificent.

01:40:18.610 --> 01:40:21.570
This is clearly a proton collapse.

01:40:21.570 --> 01:40:25.700
We're also detecting a fair number of what we believe to be unknown particles.

01:40:25.700 --> 01:40:28.790
If we can put this into a theoretical framework, physics...

01:40:28.790 --> 01:40:30.210
No, science...

01:40:30.210 --> 01:40:33.290
Humanity itself could touch the fundamental truths of the universe!

01:40:35.710 --> 01:40:37.510
Wait! That's...

01:40:37.510 --> 01:40:39.800
We still haven't finished making our adjustments.

01:40:40.220 --> 01:40:41.800
Uh, Colonel!

01:40:47.140 --> 01:40:49.020
T-That's...

01:40:52.150 --> 01:40:53.610
You bastard!

01:40:53.610 --> 01:40:55.150
What did I tell you?!

01:40:55.150 --> 01:40:56.570
But...

01:40:56.570 --> 01:40:59.700
I couldn't throw away such a magnificent subject!

01:41:00.610 --> 01:41:01.610
Shut up!

01:41:25.260 --> 01:41:25.800
Shit!

01:41:25.800 --> 01:41:27.140
It's on fire!

01:41:27.140 --> 01:41:28.930
The battery! The battery!

01:41:28.930 --> 01:41:30.140
My bike!

01:41:30.140 --> 01:41:31.480
It's burning up!

01:41:31.480 --> 01:41:34.060
Hey. What's a bike or two?

01:41:34.060 --> 01:41:35.190
What?

01:41:35.190 --> 01:41:38.150
Then, there's nothing wrong with using yours, right?

01:41:38.150 --> 01:41:39.320
You heard that?

01:41:39.320 --> 01:41:40.320
Yeah, I did!

01:41:40.320 --> 01:41:42.740
Hey, your bike's still on fire.

01:42:24.200 --> 01:42:25.280
Tetsuo-kun?

01:42:37.250 --> 01:42:41.550
Why does everyone call you "Akira"?

01:42:41.550 --> 01:42:45.260
He never existed in the first place.

01:42:46.300 --> 01:42:48.300
They didn't care who it was.

01:42:51.010 --> 01:42:53.060
Just so long as he destroyed things...

01:42:53.930 --> 01:42:55.270
Your arm!

01:42:56.600 --> 01:42:58.230
It doesn't look like much...

01:42:58.230 --> 01:42:59.980
...but it works pretty good.

01:43:03.360 --> 01:43:04.360
What's wrong?

01:43:04.360 --> 01:43:05.490
Are you okay?

01:43:08.450 --> 01:43:09.320
It's nothing!

01:43:09.990 --> 01:43:10.870
Tetsuo-kun...

01:43:10.870 --> 01:43:12.620
Shut up! Just go away!

01:43:20.340 --> 01:43:21.590
Medicine...

01:43:22.460 --> 01:43:24.210
What's wrong, Tetsuo?

01:43:24.210 --> 01:43:25.970
Are you in pain?

01:43:25.970 --> 01:43:28.010
Go back to the lab...

01:43:28.010 --> 01:43:29.930
And get me some of that medicine!

01:43:29.930 --> 01:43:30.800
Doctor...

01:43:30.800 --> 01:43:31.640
Did you hear that?

01:43:31.640 --> 01:43:33.140
Yes, Colonel.

01:43:33.140 --> 01:43:33.770
Well?

01:43:33.770 --> 01:43:34.980
Can you see any signs of it?

01:43:35.480 --> 01:43:37.600
I'm not entirely certain...

01:43:38.150 --> 01:43:41.940
...but it seems that the power that
had been held back by the drugs is breaking free.

01:43:42.480 --> 01:43:46.150
He may not be able to control the power that has awakened so suddenly.

01:43:46.150 --> 01:43:48.660
At any rate, he's in an extremely dangerous condition!

01:43:49.660 --> 01:43:52.490
If you don't go back to the lab and receive proper treatment...

01:43:52.490 --> 01:43:53.990
You may die!

01:43:57.080 --> 01:44:01.040
You want me to enroll in that kindergarten and live happily ever after?

01:44:01.040 --> 01:44:02.880
Take my medicine every day...

01:44:02.880 --> 01:44:06.630
And shrivel up like those kids?!

01:44:11.760 --> 01:44:12.640
Kaori...

01:44:13.600 --> 01:44:14.640
Kaori...

01:44:15.930 --> 01:44:16.890
Please...

01:44:17.850 --> 01:44:19.310
I need that medicine...

01:44:19.850 --> 01:44:21.310
No!

01:44:21.810 --> 01:44:22.730
Tetsuo!

01:44:24.610 --> 01:44:25.940
Tetsuo-kun!

01:44:27.780 --> 01:44:28.820
Tetsu...

01:45:00.850 --> 01:45:02.480
Kaneda?!

01:45:40.810 --> 01:45:41.390
Huh?

01:45:49.400 --> 01:45:51.150
Son of a...

01:45:54.990 --> 01:45:56.120
You kids...

01:45:56.120 --> 01:45:56.910
What are you doing here?

01:46:03.330 --> 01:46:05.080
You never learn, do you?

01:46:07.460 --> 01:46:08.750
Tetsuo!

01:46:23.440 --> 01:46:24.560
Takashi...

01:46:27.650 --> 01:46:29.070
Akira-kun...

01:46:42.450 --> 01:46:43.830
Kaneda...

01:46:43.830 --> 01:46:46.000
Help me!

01:46:55.260 --> 01:46:57.140
Kaori...

01:47:00.640 --> 01:47:03.060
Help me!

01:47:14.610 --> 01:47:16.910
Help me!

01:47:16.910 --> 01:47:18.490
Stop it!

01:47:35.720 --> 01:47:36.760
Kaori...

01:47:36.760 --> 01:47:37.800
Kaori!

01:47:38.220 --> 01:47:39.680
Kaori!

01:47:39.680 --> 01:47:41.100
Tetsuo?

01:47:41.100 --> 01:47:42.560
Is that you, Tetsuo?!

01:47:42.560 --> 01:47:43.970
Kaori is...

01:47:43.970 --> 01:47:45.730
Kaori is gonna die!

01:47:45.730 --> 01:47:47.020
What?!

01:47:47.020 --> 01:47:48.650
What did you say?!

01:47:48.650 --> 01:47:51.110
My body's not doing what I tell it to!

01:47:51.110 --> 01:47:52.820
My power's acting on its own!

01:47:53.780 --> 01:47:54.730
Kaori!

01:47:56.280 --> 01:47:58.450
Kaori's dying!

01:47:58.450 --> 01:47:59.360
Kaneda!

01:47:59.360 --> 01:48:00.820
Help me!

01:48:00.820 --> 01:48:02.910
Stop, Tetsuo!

01:48:02.910 --> 01:48:04.950
Stop it!

01:48:04.950 --> 01:48:08.750
Kaori's pain is coming into me!

01:48:10.460 --> 01:48:13.250
Tetsuo!

01:48:13.250 --> 01:48:15.760
Kaneda!

01:48:15.760 --> 01:48:17.170
Run away!

01:48:29.890 --> 01:48:32.400
Tetsuo!

01:48:43.870 --> 01:48:44.780
Kiyoko!

01:48:44.780 --> 01:48:45.990
Takashi! Masaru!

01:48:45.990 --> 01:48:47.870
Get away from here!

01:48:51.960 --> 01:48:53.380
Come on!

01:48:59.760 --> 01:49:01.130
I can't believe it.

01:49:01.130 --> 01:49:02.140
It's as if...

01:49:15.150 --> 01:49:16.650
Kiyoko!

01:49:16.650 --> 01:49:18.150
Taka...

01:49:52.480 --> 01:49:53.190
Hi.

01:49:55.150 --> 01:49:56.360
Akira-kun...

01:50:04.820 --> 01:50:06.830
T-This is...

01:50:08.330 --> 01:50:09.370
But that's...

01:50:09.370 --> 01:50:10.330
Oh, no!

01:50:20.000 --> 01:50:21.510
W-Where am I?

01:50:22.510 --> 01:50:23.300
Hurry!

01:50:23.300 --> 01:50:24.930
Get into the tunnel!

01:50:24.930 --> 01:50:26.390
You'll be safe in there.

01:50:26.390 --> 01:50:27.260
Kiyoko!

01:50:27.260 --> 01:50:28.180
Where are you?

01:50:42.990 --> 01:50:44.780
Tetsuo!

01:50:44.780 --> 01:50:47.280
Kaneda!

01:50:47.660 --> 01:50:48.620
Hang on!

01:50:51.040 --> 01:50:52.290
If you don't get out of here now, you'll...

01:50:52.290 --> 01:50:53.620
Out of the way!

01:50:53.620 --> 01:50:55.290
Tetsuo!

01:50:55.290 --> 01:50:56.880
Don't go!

01:51:03.760 --> 01:51:04.590
No!

01:51:04.590 --> 01:51:06.130
Takashi-kun!

01:51:06.130 --> 01:51:07.510
If you went in now...

01:51:07.510 --> 01:51:09.640
You'd be trapped, too.

01:51:09.640 --> 01:51:10.890
But...

01:51:11.600 --> 01:51:13.640
None of this is his fault!

01:51:20.690 --> 01:51:22.030
Takashi!

01:51:22.030 --> 01:51:23.610
Takashi-kun!

01:51:30.160 --> 01:51:31.580
If we went in...

01:51:32.660 --> 01:51:36.080
We wouldn't be strong enough to come back out.

01:51:37.210 --> 01:51:38.000
But...

01:51:38.000 --> 01:51:39.540
If the three of us worked together...

01:51:39.540 --> 01:51:41.500
Maybe we could at least save that boy.

01:51:41.500 --> 01:51:43.170
You're right.

01:51:43.170 --> 01:51:44.760
Together, the three of us could...

01:51:53.810 --> 01:51:55.980
Oh, man...

01:51:55.980 --> 01:51:57.520
We should get out of here.

01:51:57.520 --> 01:51:58.600
Hey!

01:51:59.560 --> 01:52:01.150
Kaneda-kun...

01:52:34.060 --> 01:52:35.270
Look...

01:52:35.270 --> 01:52:37.390
You're not revving your engine enough.

01:52:37.390 --> 01:52:39.480
When you go into a corner, lean like you're trying to kill yourself.

01:52:39.480 --> 01:52:40.060
Got it?

01:52:40.060 --> 01:52:41.230
Watch!

01:52:41.230 --> 01:52:43.060
What are you doing?

01:52:43.060 --> 01:52:44.820
Cornering, man.

01:52:46.400 --> 01:52:48.490
Got it, Tetsuo?

01:52:54.620 --> 01:52:55.120
Look.

01:52:55.120 --> 01:52:56.370
There's another one!

01:52:56.370 --> 01:52:57.200
Another transfer student?

01:52:57.200 --> 01:52:58.750
He was abandoned.

01:52:58.750 --> 01:53:00.710
You can see it in his face.

01:53:04.380 --> 01:53:05.630
Are these...

01:53:06.300 --> 01:53:08.300
Are these your dreams?

01:53:08.300 --> 01:53:09.300
Tetsuo?

01:53:11.010 --> 01:53:11.800
Wait!

01:54:29.420 --> 01:54:31.050
This is...

01:54:31.050 --> 01:54:32.220
Akira?

01:54:32.670 --> 01:54:33.800
Yes.

01:54:33.800 --> 01:54:36.090
We called him...

01:54:36.090 --> 01:54:38.510
To have him take Tetsuo-kun away...

01:54:38.510 --> 01:54:40.060
Take him away?

01:54:40.720 --> 01:54:41.970
Take him where?

01:54:41.970 --> 01:54:44.440
It's too much for Tetsuo-kun.

01:54:44.440 --> 01:54:45.900
And for us...

01:54:45.900 --> 01:54:47.310
And for Akira-kun...

01:54:47.900 --> 01:54:51.190
It's too big for us as we are now.

01:54:51.730 --> 01:54:52.650
But...

01:54:52.650 --> 01:54:54.860
Someday, we'll also be able to...

01:54:55.740 --> 01:54:58.070
You see, it's already begun.

01:54:58.910 --> 01:55:01.410
Your friend's...

01:55:01.410 --> 01:55:02.450
My friend?

01:55:04.000 --> 01:55:04.830
Kei!

01:55:05.420 --> 01:55:06.920
You mean Kei, don't you?

01:55:32.650 --> 01:55:33.860
Tetsuo...

01:55:38.910 --> 01:55:40.070
This is yours, right?

01:55:46.580 --> 01:55:49.540
They're always like that with the new kids.

01:55:49.540 --> 01:55:50.880
You came today, right?

01:55:50.880 --> 01:55:52.710
They beat me up, too...

01:55:52.710 --> 01:55:53.670
But the truth is...

01:55:53.670 --> 01:55:55.590
Those guys are wimps.

01:55:56.010 --> 01:55:57.340
I'm...

01:55:57.340 --> 01:55:58.340
Tetsuo...

01:55:59.010 --> 01:56:00.390
Shima Tetsuo...

01:56:02.010 --> 01:56:03.390
To tell you the truth...

